	"Set the variable name": "设置变量名称",
	"The variable name '%S' already exists. Do you want to merge the two variables?": "变量名'%S'已存在。是否合并两个变量？",
	"<hl>Behaviors</> offer means of customized automation of your units and buildings with a simple programming interface.\n\nThe game is designed to be enjoyed fully without using behaviors! But give them a go if you are inclined to eradicate a manual process or to maximize throughput in your base.\n\nA <hl>Behavior</> runs <hl>Instructions</> on one of your <hl>Units</> or <hl>Buildings</> in sequential order. <hl>Instructions</> can affect the behavior of <hl>Units</> and <hl>Buildings</>, branch the running sequence based on conditions or modify the value of a <hl>Parameter</> or <hl>Register</>. Check out the help topics for more details on the editor interface and general use of behaviors.": "<hl>行为</>通过简易编程插槽，为装置与建筑提供定制化自动化方案。\n\n本游戏设计无需使用行为即可畅玩！但若您希望解放双手或最大化基地产能，不妨尝试运用行为系统。\n\n<hl>行为</>会按顺序让<hl>指令</>在您的<hl>装置</>或<hl>建筑</>上指令。<hl>指令</>可影响<hl>装置</>和<hl>建筑</>的行为，根据条件分支运行序列，或修改<hl>参数</>或<hl>寄存器</>的数值。有关编辑器界面及行为功能的详细说明，请查阅相关帮助主题。",
	"Close Tutorial": "关闭教程", // <temporary automatic translation>
