	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial": "点击“下一步”完成教程", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Waiting for this step...": "等待这一步……", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Use Next when you are ready.": "准备就绪后，请使用“下一步”。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Press Next to Complete the Tutorial": "步骤完成。按“下一步”完成教程。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Press Next when you are ready.": "步骤完成。准备就绪后，请按“下一步”。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Step complete. Advancing...": "步骤完成。正在继续……", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"The customizable icon of the behavior and a button for advanced behavior restart options.": "行为的自定义图标及高级行为重启选项按钮。",
	"The customizable name and description of the behavior.\n\nBelow the description you'll find information about how many units and buildings have the behavior loaded and how many are actively running it at the moment.": "行为的自定义名称与描述。\n\n描述下方将显示当前加载该行为的装置与建筑数量，以及正在运行该行为的活跃数量。",
	"Buttons to save the behavior under a different name, clearing of the entire behavior, and access to this help screen.": "用于以不同名称保存行为、清除整个行为以及访问此帮助界面的按钮。",
	"The <hl>base registers</> which can be used as input or output values of the behavior. They can also be set via the unit/building interface.": "可作为行为输入或输出值的<hl>基址寄存器</>。这些寄存器也可通过单元/建筑界面进行设置。",
	"The list of <hl>parameters</> specific to the behavior. Any parameter can be an input or output value, or both. These correspond to the registers on the behavior controller visible in the unit/building interface.": "行为专用的<hl>参数</>列表。任何参数均可作为输入值、输出值或兼具双重属性。这些参数对应装置/建筑界面中可见的行为控制器所使用的寄存器。",
	"The list of available <hl>instructions</> which can be dragged into the working area.": "可用<hl>指令</>列表，可拖拽至工作区域",
	"The <hl>working area</> contains the instruction nodes which are connected to form the sequence of performed operations.\n\nYou can scroll the area by dragging empty space or by using WASD keys. To zoom it, use the mouse wheel or the buttons in the top right.\n\nIt is also possible to use right-click on empty space or on a connection point to quickly find and insert a new instruction.": "<hl>工作区域</>包含相互连接的指令节点，这些节点共同构成执行的操作序列。\n\n可通过拖动空白区域或使用WASD键进行滚动。缩放操作请使用鼠标滚轮或右上角按钮。\n\n此外，在空白区域或连接点上单击右键，可快速定位并插入新指令。",
	"The camera view showing the unit that is currently being inspected.": "摄像头视角会显示当前正在检查的装置。",
	"The information box for the currently selected instruction. It can be expanded to show more details and example code that can be added to the behavior.": "当前选定指令的信息框。可展开以显示更多详细信息和示例代码，可以把这些代码添加到行为中。",
	"The first button here will switch the screen between displaying the active values in the currently inspected behavior controller and the code identifiers for parameters and variables.\nThe second button lets you select which behavior controller of your units to inspect.": "第一个按钮可在当前检查的行为控制器中切换显示活动的值、参数或是变量的代码标识符。\n第二个按钮可让您选择要检查的装置行为控制器。",
	"Buttons to stop, start, pause, continue or step the behavior. Only available when a specific behavior controller is being inspected.": "该按钮可用于停止、启动、暂停、继续或逐步执行行为。仅在检查特定行为控制器时可用。",
	"These buttons undo or redo changes step by step.": "这些按钮可逐步撤销或重做更改。",
	"Buttons to close the editor and to apply or discard changes. Running the behavior will automatically apply any unsaved changes as well.": "该按钮可关闭编辑器，并且应用或放弃更改。运行行为时未保存的更改也会自动应用。",
