	"Store": "存储",
	"<header>Store</>\n<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> or <hl>Drag</>\n\nSet to an owned <hl>unit</> or <hl>building</> to transfer inventory when possible.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> to set the minimum transfer amount.": "<header>存储</>\n<hl>按住Ctrl键</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>或<hl>拖动</>\n\n尽可能将其设置为已拥有的<hl>单元</>或<hl>建筑物</>以转移库存。\n\n使用<Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/>设置最小转移数量。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"<header>Visual</>\n\nShown in the game world, useful to link to production\nby dragging from the <hl>Production</> to the <hl>Visual</>\n\nChange visibility with <Key action=\"MapOverlay\" style=\"hl\"/>": "<header>视觉</>\n\n在游戏画面中显示，可通过从<hl>生产</>拖动到<hl>视觉</>，将其链接到生产\n\n\n使用<Key action=\"MapOverlay\" style=\"hl\"/>更改显示",
	"<header>Signal</>\n\nThe unit or building emits this signal which can be read\nthrough signal related components or through behaviors.\n\nUseful for advanced automation": "<header>信号</>\n\n该装置或建筑会发出此信号，可通过信号相关组件或行为进行读取。\n\n适用于高级自动化。",

