	// FILE: Main/ui/behavior_guides.lua
	"Pickup Bot Behavior": "取货机器人行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a simple pickup bot: scan for a dropped item, pick it up, repeat until full, then drop everything at a storage target. Use Next and Previous at any time; steps that can be detected advance automatically.": "本指南将构建一个简单的拾取机器人：扫描掉落物品，拾取物品，重复此操作直至物品数量达到上限，然后将所有物品放置到目标存储位置。您可以随时使用“下一步”和“上一步”按钮；可检测到的步骤会自动推进。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add one behavior parameter and rename it <hl>Storage</> by clicking on its name. The bot needs a visible destination so the finished behavior can be reused with any storage building.": "添加一个行为参数，点击其名称将其重命名为<hl>Storage</>。机器人需要一个可见的目标位置，以便完成的行为可以复用于任何存储建筑。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"In the instruction list, open the <hl>Components</> category and drag <hl>Radar</> after the <hl>Program Start</> node. Use it to search for the closest dropped item. Radar returns a target reference, not an item type.": "在指令列表中，打开<hl>组件</>类别，并将<hl>雷达</>拖到<hl>程序启动</>节点之后。使用它来搜索最近的已放置项。雷达返回的是目标引用，而不是项类型。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"When a node is selected, this help area shows extra information about how to use it. For Radar, the Result output is the thing in the world that matches the filter, which later instructions can move to or pick up from.": "选中节点后，此帮助区域会显示有关如何使用该节点的额外信息。对于雷达而言，“结果”输出是与筛选条件匹配的对象，后续指令可以将其移动到此处或从此处继续执行。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"text": "文本", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set the first Radar filter to <img id=\"v_droppeditem\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>. Click the Radar node's <hl>Filter 1</> register and choose Dropped Item from the <hl>Information</> tab so Radar only finds item stacks on the ground.": "将第一个雷达过滤器设置为 <img id=\"v_droppeditem\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。单击雷达节点的 <hl>过滤器 1</> 注册，然后从 <hl>信息</> 选项卡中选择掉落物品，以便雷达只查找地面上的物品堆。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Check Space": "空格", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Check Space for Item</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Radar node, which is the normal path when Radar found something. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>检查物品空间</>。将其拖到雷达节点的第一个/默认输出引脚上，这是雷达发现物品时的正常路径。不要将其连接到<hl>无结果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Now pass the found target into Check Space for Item. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the Radar node to the <hl>Item</> register on the Check Space for Item node. The editor will automatically create a local variable to pass the Radar result along.": "现在将找到的目标传递给“检查项目空间”节点。将雷达节点上的 <hl>结果</> 寄存器拖到“检查项目空间”节点上的 <hl>项目</> 寄存器。编辑器会自动创建一个局部变量来传递雷达结果。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Pick Up": "捡起", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Pick Up Items</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Check Space for Item node, which is the normal path when the item fits. Do not attach it to <hl>Can't Fit</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>拾取物品</>。将其拖到“检查物品空间”节点的第一个/默认输出引脚上，这是物品可以放入时的正常路径。不要将其连接到<hl>无法放入</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Now pass the same found target into Pick Up Items. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the Radar node to the <hl>Source</> register on the Pick Up Items node. The editor will reuse the local variable carrying the Radar result. Leave Item / Amount empty so it picks up anything from the dropped item entity.": "现在将找到的目标传递给“拾取物品”节点。将雷达节点上的<hl>结果</>寄存器拖到拾取物品节点上的<hl>来源</>寄存器。编辑器将重用存储雷达结果的局部变量。将“物品”/“数量”留空，以便拾取掉落物品实体中的任何物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Drop Off": "下车", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Drop Off Items</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>Can't Fit</> pin of the Check Space for Item node. This sends the bot to unload when it cannot fit the item Radar found.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>卸货</>。将其拖放到“检查物品空间”节点的<hl>无法放置</>引脚上。这样，当雷达检测到的物品无法放置时，机器人就会卸载物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Connect the <hl>Storage</> parameter to the <hl>Destination</> register on Drop Off Items. Leave Item / Amount empty so Drop Off Items unloads everything the bot is carrying.": "将<hl>存储</>参数连接到“卸货”功能的<hl>目的地</>寄存器。将“物品/数量”留空，以便“卸货”功能卸载机器人携带的所有物品。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Wait Ticks</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the Radar node. You can set its <hl>Time</> register to how many ticks to wait; <hl>5</> means 5 ticks, which is 1 second.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>等待时钟周期</>。将其拖到雷达节点的<hl>无结果</>引脚上。您可以将其<hl>时间</>寄存器设置为等待的时钟周期数；<hl>5</>表示5个时钟周期，即1秒。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press <hl>Apply</> to save the behavior.": "按<hl>应用</>保存此行为。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"icon": "图标", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Exit the behavior editor with the button in the bottom right and select the unit running this behavior. You will see the parameter registers above the behavior; set the <hl>Storage</> register there by choosing the storage unit or building to unload into. You can also start or stop the behavior from this same panel. If it stalls, return to the editor and inspect the node register values.": "使用右下角的按钮退出行为编辑器，然后选择运行此行为的单元。您将在行为上方看到参数寄存器；通过选择要卸载到的存储单元或建筑物，设置 <hl>Storage</> 寄存器。您也可以从同一面板启动或停止行为。如果行为停止，请返回编辑器并检查节点寄存器值。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Safe Miner Behavior": "安全矿工行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a miner that checks for enemies first. If an enemy is detected it goes to your home location; if no enemy is detected it scans for a mineable resource and mines it.": "本指南将介绍如何建造一台采矿机，它会先检查是否有敌人出现。如果检测到敌人，它会返回你的基地；如果没有检测到敌人，它会扫描可开采的资源并进行开采。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"In the instruction list, open the <hl>Components</> category and drag <hl>Radar</> after the <hl>Program Start</> node. This first Radar is the safety check.": "在指令列表中，打开<hl>组件</>类别，并将<hl>雷达</>拖到<hl>程序启动</>节点之后。第一个“雷达”是安全检查。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set this Radar node's <hl>Filter 1</> register to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Click Filter 1, open the <hl>Information</> tab, and choose Enemy.": "将此雷达节点的<hl>过滤器 1</>注册设置为<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敌人</>。单击过滤器 1，打开<hl>信息</>选项卡，然后选择敌人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the enemy Radar node, which is the path used when Radar found an enemy. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>回家</>。将其拖到敌方雷达节点的第一个/默认输出引脚上，该引脚是雷达发现敌人时使用的路径。不要将其连接到<hl>无结果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. This makes the unit move after the home unit has been found.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>移动单元</>指令。将其拖到“回家”指令的第一个/默认输出引脚上。这样，在找到回家单元后，该单元就会移动。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the retreat target. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on Get Home to the <hl>Target</> register on Move Unit. The editor will create a local variable carrying your home location.": "设置撤退目标。将 Get Home 函数的 <hl>Result</> 寄存器拖到 Move Unit 函数的 <hl>Target</> 寄存器。编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储你的原点位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add a second <hl>Radar</> node. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the enemy Radar node. This second Radar only runs when no enemy was detected.": "添加第二个<hl>雷达</>节点。将其拖到敌方雷达节点的<hl>无结果</>引脚上。第二个雷达仅在未检测到敌人时运行。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Select the second Radar node and set its <hl>Filter 1</> register to <img id=\"v_mineable\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Mineable</>. Use the Information tab so it finds mineable resource deposits.": "选择第二个雷达节点，并将其<hl>过滤器 1</>寄存器设置为<img id=\"v_mineable\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>可开采</>。使用“信息”选项卡查找可开采的资源矿藏。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Mine</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the resource Radar node, which is the path used when Radar found a resource. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>Mine</>。将其拖到资源雷达节点的第一个/默认输出引脚上，该引脚是雷达发现资源时使用的路径。不要将其连接到<hl>No Result</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the mining target. Drag from the <hl>Result</> register on the resource Radar node to the <hl>Resource</> register on the Mine node. The editor will create a local variable carrying the resource deposit.": "连接采矿目标。将资源雷达节点上的<hl>结果</>寄存器拖到采矿节点上的<hl>资源</>寄存器。编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储资源储量。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Wait Ticks</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of the resource Radar node. Set <hl>Time</> to 5 if you want it to wait 1 second before scanning again.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>等待滴答</>。将其拖到资源雷达节点的<hl>无结果</>引脚上。如果希望在再次扫描前等待1秒，请将<hl>时间</>设置为5。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press <hl>Apply</> to save the behavior. Use it on a unit with a mining component.": "按<hl>应用</>保存此行为。将其应用于带有采矿组件的单位。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Exit the behavior editor in the bottom right, select the miner, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "从右下角退出行为编辑器，选择矿工，然后从单位的行为面板启动或停止该行为。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Run Away Behavior": "逃跑行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a reactive run-away behavior. A Radar writes an enemy target into a behavior parameter, and a Parameter Event immediately runs a branch that gets your home location and moves the unit there.": "本指南构建了一个响应式逃跑行为。雷达会将敌方目标写入行为参数，参数事件会立即执行一个分支，获取你的基地位置并将单位移动到那里。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add one behavior parameter and rename it <hl>Enemy</>. This parameter stores the current enemy target and is also the value watched by the event branch.": "添加一个行为参数并将其重命名为<hl>Enemy</>。此参数存储当前敌人目标，也是事件分支监视的值。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radar</> from the <hl>Components</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. This polling branch is useful when the behavior controller does not already have a radar component feeding the Enemy parameter.": "在 <hl>程序开始</> 之后，从 <hl>组件</> 类别中添加 <hl>雷达</>。当行为控制器中还没有雷达组件为“敌人”参数提供数据时，此轮询分支非常有用。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Radar <hl>Filter 1</> to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Click Filter 1, open the <hl>Information</> tab, and choose Enemy.": "将雷达<hl>过滤器 1</>设置为<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敌人</>。单击过滤器 1，打开<hl>信息</>选项卡，然后选择敌人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Drag from the Radar <hl>Result</> register to the <hl>Enemy</> parameter register above the graph. This stores the detected enemy in the behavior parameter.": "将雷达<hl>结果</>寄存器拖到图表上方的<hl>敌人</>参数寄存器。这样就能将检测到的敌人存储在行为参数中。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"If the behavior controller has a radar component, this Radar node is optional. Instead, link the radar component's enemy/result register directly to the behavior's <hl>Enemy</> parameter register on the unit panel. The Parameter Event branch will still react when Enemy changes.": "如果行为控制器包含雷达组件，则此雷达节点是可选的。您可以改为将雷达组件的敌人/结果寄存器直接链接到单位面板上行为的<hl>敌人</>参数寄存器。当敌人发生变化时，参数事件分支仍然会做出反应。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Parameter Event</> from the instruction list. Place it as a separate branch, not connected to Program Start.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>参数事件</>。将其放在一个单独的分支中，不要连接到程序启动分支。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set which parameter the event listens to. In the <hl>Parameter Event</> node body, click <hl>Select</> and choose the <hl>Enemy</> parameter. This makes the event branch run whenever the value of <hl>Enemy</> changes.": "设置事件监听的参数。在<hl>参数事件</>节点主体中，单击<hl>选择</>并选择<hl>敌人</>参数。这样，​​当<hl>敌人</>的值发生变化时，事件分支就会运行。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of the Parameter Event node. This branch starts whenever the value of <hl>Enemy</> changes.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>回家</>。将其拖到参数事件节点的第一个/默认输出引脚上。每当<hl>敌人</>的值发生变化时，此分支就会启动。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</> so the behavior waits while moving home.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>移动单元</>。将其拖到“回家”指令的第一个/默认输出引脚上。将其设置为<hl>同步</>，以便在移动回原点时保持等待状态。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the home target. Drag from the Get Home <hl>Result</> register to the Move Unit <hl>Target</> register. The editor will create a local variable carrying the home target.": "连接回零目标。将<hl>获取回零</>寄存器中的数据拖到<hl>移动单元</>寄存器中的数据。编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储回零目标。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of <hl>Move Unit</> unconnected. Reaching the end of this event branch finishes the reaction, then the behavior can keep waiting for the next Enemy parameter change.": "将<hl>移动单位</>的末尾保持断开状态。到达此事件分支的末尾将完成响应，然后行为可以继续等待下一个敌人参数的变化。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start the behavior. If using a radar component instead of the Radar node, link that component's enemy/result register to the behavior's <hl>Enemy</> parameter register above the behavior.": "按“下一步”完成教程。退出行为编辑器，选择单位，然后启动行为。如果使用雷达组件而不是雷达节点，请将该组件的敌人/结果寄存器链接到行为上方的<hl>敌人</>参数寄存器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Battery Return Home Behavior": "电池返回家园行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a battery saving behavior. It reads the unit's battery percentage, compares it to 30, and sends the unit home when the battery is 30% or lower. You can change 30 to whatever battery percent you want to check.": "本指南旨在建立省电模式。它会读取设备的电池电量百分比，并将其与 30% 进行比较，当电量低于 30% 时，设备会自动返回充电座。您可以将 30% 更改为您想要检查的任何电量百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Battery</> from the <hl>Units</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. Leave its optional Unit register empty so it checks the unit running the behavior.": "在<hl>单元</>类别中，于<hl>程序启动</>之后添加<hl>获取电池</>功能。将其可选的“单元”寄存器留空，以便它检查运行该行为的单元。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Compare Number</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Battery.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>比较编号</>。将其拖到“获取电池”功能的第一个/默认输出引脚上。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the battery value. Drag from the Get Battery <hl>Percent</> register to the Compare Number <hl>Value</> register. The editor will create a local variable carrying the battery percent.": "将电池值连接到寄存器。从<hl>获取电池百分比</>寄存器拖动到<hl>比较数值</>寄存器。编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储电池百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Compare Number <hl>Compare</> to <hl>30</>. This means the return-home branch will run when battery percent is equal to 30 or smaller than 30. You can use any percent you want later.": "将比较数值<hl>比较</>设置为<hl>30</>。这意味着当电池电量百分比等于或小于30%时，返航分支将运行。您稍后可以设置任何您想要的百分比。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>If Equal</> pin of Compare Number. Then also connect Compare Number's <hl>If Smaller</> pin to the same Get Home node.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>Get Home</>。将其拖到“比较数字”节点的<hl>If Equal</>引脚上。然后将“比较数字”节点的<hl>If Smaller</>引脚也连接到同一个“Get Home”节点。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</> so the behavior waits while the unit returns home.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>移动单元</>。将其拖到“返航”指令的第一个/默认输出引脚上。将其设置为<hl>同步</>，以便在单元返回原点时执行此操作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of Move Unit unconnected, and leave Compare Number's <hl>If Larger</> pin empty for now. Reaching the end restarts the behavior, so it keeps checking the battery. Later you can attach any normal-work branch to <hl>If Larger</>.": "暂时不要连接“移动单元”的末端，也不要连接“比较数字”的<hl>如果更大</>引脚。到达末端会重新启动程序，因此它会持续检查电池电量。之后，您可以将任何正常工作分支连接到<hl>如果更大</>引脚。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "按“下一步”完成教程。退出行为编辑器，选择单元，然后从单元的行为面板启动或停止行为。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Scout With Enemy Avoidance Behavior": "侦察兵规避敌方行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds a scout that checks for enemies before moving. If it sees an enemy it goes home; if it sees no enemy it scouts a random nearby area and stores its latest location for the next scout move.": "本指南将指导您如何建造一个侦察兵，它会在移动前检查是否有敌人出现。如果发现敌人，它会返回基地；如果没有发现敌人，它会侦察附近随机区域，并将最新位置保存下来，以便下次侦察行动使用。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radar</> from the <hl>Components</> category after <hl>Program Start</>. This Radar is the danger check.": "在<hl>程序启动</>之后，从<hl>组件</>类别中添加<hl>雷达</>。此雷达用于危险检查。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Radar <hl>Filter 1</> to <img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>Enemy</>. Use the Information tab.": "将雷达<hl>过滤器 1</>设置为<img id=\"v_enemy_faction\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <hl>敌人</>。使用“信息”选项卡。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Home</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Radar, which is the path used when an enemy was found. Do not attach it to <hl>No Result</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>回家</>。将其拖到雷达的第一个/默认输出引脚上，该引脚用于发现敌人时使用的路径。不要将其附加到<hl>无结果</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Get Home. This is the retreat action.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>移动单元</>。将其拖到“返航”指令的第一个/默认输出引脚上。这是撤退操作。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the retreat target. Drag from Get Home <hl>Result</> to Move Unit <hl>Target</>. The editor will create a local variable carrying the home target.": "设置撤退目标。从“返回原点”<hl>结果</>拖动到“移动单位”<hl>目标</>。编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储返回原点目标。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Scout Range</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the <hl>No Result</> pin of Radar, which is the path used when no enemy was found.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>侦察范围</>。将其拖到雷达的<hl>无结果</>图钉上，该图钉用于显示未发现敌人时的路径。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set Scout Range <hl>Range</> to <hl>5</>. This controls how far the scout tries to move each time.": "将侦察范围<hl>Range</>设置为<hl>5</>。这将控制侦察兵每次尝试移动的距离。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Get Location</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Scout Range, as shown in the example graph. This records where the scout ended up after the move.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>获取位置</>。将其拖到侦察范围的第一个/默认输出引脚上，如示例图所示。这将记录侦察兵移动后的最终位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the scout's previous position. Drag from Get Location <hl>Coord</> to Scout Range <hl>Coord</>. The editor will create a local variable, so each new scout move can use the last location as direction context.": "将侦察兵的先前位置绑定到坐标系中。从“获取位置”<hl>坐标</>拖动到“侦察范围”<hl>坐标</>。编辑器将创建一个局部变量，以便每次新的侦察兵移动都可以使用上次的位置作为方向上下文。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the ends of <hl>Move Unit</> and <hl>Get Location</> unconnected. The behavior restarts after each branch, so it checks for enemies before every scout move.": "将<hl>移动单位</>和<hl>获取位置</>的端点保持断开状态。行为会在每个分支之后重新开始，因此它会在每次侦察移动之前检查是否有敌人。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"tooltip": "工具提示", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"To watch the scout while testing, click <hl>View Options</> in the bottom-left camera preview and raise <hl>Show Behind Editor</>. This lets you monitor the unit behind the behavior editor as it runs.": "要在测试时观察侦察兵，请点击左下角摄像头预览中的<hl>查看选项</>，然后勾选<hl>显示编辑器后方</>。这样您就可以在行为编辑器运行时监控其背后的单元。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the scout, and start or stop the behavior from the unit's behavior panel.": "按“下一步”完成教程。退出行为编辑器，选择侦察兵，然后从单位的行为面板启动或停止该行为。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Signal-Controlled Move Behavior": "信号控制移动行为", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This guide builds an event-driven behavior. A Radio Event waits for a radio signal on a chosen band; when the signal changes, the unit moves to the signal's target.": "本指南构建了一个事件驱动行为。无线电事件会等待选定频段上的无线电信号；当信号发生变化时，设备会移动到信号的目标位置。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Radio Event</> from the <hl>Communication</> category. Place it as a separate branch, not connected to Program Start.": "从<hl>通信</>类别中添加<hl>无线电事件</>。将其放置在单独的分支中，不要连接到“节目开始”分支。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Set the Radio Event <hl>Band</> in the node body. Click its Band register and choose a value you will also use when sending the radio signal. If no band is selected, the event will not watch anything.": "在节点主体中设置无线电事件的<hl>频段</>。单击其频段寄存器，并选择一个您在发送无线电信号时也将使用的值。如果未选择频段，则该事件将不会监听任何内容。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Add <hl>Move Unit</> from the instruction list. Drag it onto the first/default outgoing pin of Radio Event. Leave it set to <hl>Synchronous</>.": "从指令列表中添加<hl>移动单元</>。将其拖到无线电事件的第一个/默认输出引脚上。将其设置为<hl>同步</>。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Wire the signal target. Drag from the Radio Event <hl>Signal</> register to the Move Unit <hl>Target</> register. The signal should be a unit or coordinate target; the editor will create a local variable carrying it.": "连接信号目标。将“无线电事件”寄存器中的 <hl>信号</> 拖到“移动单元”寄存器中的 <hl>目标</> 。该信号应为单位或坐标目标；编辑器将创建一个局部变量来存储它。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Leave the end of <hl>Move Unit</> unconnected. The event branch finishes after moving, then waits for the next radio signal change on the selected band.": "将<hl>移动单元</>的末尾保持断开状态。事件分支在移动后结束，然后等待所选频段上的下一个无线电信号变化。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Press Next to Complete the Tutorial. Exit the behavior editor, select the unit, and start the behavior. To test it, equip a <img id=\"c_radio_transmitter\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> on a different unit, set that radio behavior to the same band, then set coordinates on the radio; this bot will move to those coordinates when the radio signal changes.": "点击“下一步”完成教程。退出行为编辑器，选择单元，然后启动该行为。要测试该行为，请在另一台单元上装备一个<img id=\"c_radio_transmitter\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，将该单元的无线电行为设置为相同的频段，然后在无线电上设置坐标；当无线电信号发生变化时，该机器人将移动到这些坐标。", // <temporary automatic translation>

	// FILE: Main/ui/ui.lua
	"In the full version of Desynced, further exciting adventures and tech tree exploration awaits you!\n\nWe look forward to playing alongside you in the full version!": "在完整版《智械工厂 Desynced》中，更多激动人心的冒险与科技树探索正等待着你！\n\n我们期待在完整版中与你并肩作战！",
