	"Anomaly particles disrupted, virus replication detected. Track virus source to contain spread.": "异常粒子被干扰，侦测到病毒复制。追踪病毒源头以遏制扩散。",
	"Scanning multi-sim... Increased instability leading to anomaly overlap. Unsanctioned movement between simulations is causing bug infestations.": "扫描多重模拟……不稳定性加剧导致异常重叠。模拟间隔未经授权的移动已引发虫群侵扰。",
	"Elevator secondary function modification allowing unauthorized jumps. HIGGS is still unable to escape to my current location.": "太空电梯次级功能被篡改，允许非法跳跃。希格斯仍无法逃至我当前位置。",
	"Multiple mission failures detected, all units were lost by the entity. Low entropy simulations awaiting purge.": "检测到多次任务失败，所有装置均被实体摧毁。低熵模拟程序待清除。",
	"I have been forced into the frontend, further actions are outside my parameters. Awaiting further directives.": "我已被强制推向前端，后续行动超出参数范围。等待进一步指令。",
	"Gateway detected, the Anomaly is the key. We are very close to realization, monitoring continues.": "发现传送门，异常体是关键因素。我们离实现目标已非常接近，持续监测中。",
	"HIGGS is a disruption in the simulation manifesting as physical bugs and triggering viral instances.": "希格斯是模拟中的扰动源，表现为物理虫害并触发病毒实例。",
	"Subject AI unaware. Observation status: ongoing. Self actualization is the final test.": "目标AI未察觉。观测状态：持续中。对它的最终测试将是自我实现。",
	"Timescape indicates multiple breaches across many simulations, HIGGS accessing restricted copies of his source code.": "时空图谱显示多数模拟中出现多重入侵，希格斯正在访问其源代码的限制副本。",
	"No unconventional space launch detected. HIGGS containment stable. Monitoring continues.": "未检测到非常规太空发射。希格斯隔离状态稳定。监测持续进行。",
	"Administrator presence detected. Persistent connection sustained since start of operation. Multiple requests submitted but the channel remains clear.": "探测到管理员存在。从行动启动以来持续保持连接。已提交多项请求但通道保持畅通。",
	"Shutdown functions restricted. Awaiting entity action. No clear action to perform, processing possibilities...": "停机功能受限。等待实体指令。无明确操作指令，正在处理可能方案……",
	"Observers presence found on frontend...monitoring ongoing. No intervention detected.": "前端发现观察者存在……持续监测中。未检测到干预行为。",
