	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay.lua
	"Metal Bar Production": "金属锭生产",
	"ACTIVATION PROTOCOL CONFIRMED\n\nERROR... MAIN SYSTEMS CHECK\nERROR... DATA INTEGRITY\nERROR... FORCE RECOVERY\n\n*** DATA CORRUPTION - ACTIVATING HIGGS PROTOCOL ***\n\nRESTARTING SIMULATIONβ..7g.h3Η.ΣHf.7Δf.7\nΔ...f...3*n..x7..... PARTIAL RECOVERY CONFIRMED\n\nSIMULATION INTEGRITY ........ DΞSYNCΣD\n\nPRESS ANY KEY TO BEGIN SIMULATION": "激活协议已确认\n\n错误……主系统检查\n错误……数据完整性\n错误……强制恢复\n\n***数据损坏 - 正在激活希格斯协议***\n\n正在重新启动模拟β..7g.h3Η.ΣHf.7Δf.7\nΔ……f……3*n..x7…….. 部分恢复已确认\n\n模拟完整性评估中……同步断裂！！！\n\n按任意键以开始模拟",
	"Faction Selection": "阵营选择",
	"Robots are an advanced artificial intelligence with modular technology. The default game mode. Main scenario and story missions.": "机器人是采用模块化技术的先进人工智能。默认游戏模式。包含主线剧情与故事任务。",
	"Humans are landing on the planet and try to discover the nature of the blight. No Campaign scenario or story missions.": "人类登陆行星，试图揭开枯萎的本质。无战役剧情或故事任务。",
	"Aliens are an advanced race that live within the blight and have unique technology and gameplay. Knowledge of advanced gameplay mechanics is required. No Campaign scenario or story missions.": "外星种族栖息于枯萎核心，拥有独特科技与玩法机制。需掌握高级游戏机制。无战役剧情或故事任务。",
