	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay/freeplay_codex.lua
	"The unit seems to have reverted to its original programming, we should follow it and see where it's going.": "装置似乎已恢复至初始程序，跟上它，看看它要去哪儿。",
	"<img id=\"datacube_matrix\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\nThese storage devices still have an intact matrix.\nThey can hold the information in <img id=\"robot_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/> items.\nThe similarity to our own technology means we can easily adapt our Robotics Factory to their production.": "<img id=\"datacube_matrix\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\n这些存储设备仍保有完整的矩阵建筑。\n它们能够保存<img id=\"robot_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/>项信息。\n由于与我方技术高度相似，我们可轻松将机器人工厂改造，用于该技术的相关生产。",
	"<img id=\"empty_databank\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\nThese are human data storage devices that can decompress the information in <img id=\"human_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/> items.": "<img id=\"empty_databank\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>\n这些是人类数据存储装置，能够解压<img id=\"human_datacube\" style=\"hl\"/>项信息。",
	"HIGGS": "希格斯", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"This <img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/> is not ordinary wreckage. Portions of its data layout match human archive conventions, but the execution traces are far more advanced: robotic control logic, self-optimizing fabrication notes, and machine-state records that do not belong to our current technology base.\n\nThis is a significant discovery. Preserve these datacubes and analyze them whenever possible. They unlock an entire machine sub-branch from technology that appears to be ours, but evolved through a different path.": "这件<img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>并非普通的残骸。其部分数据布局符合人类的档案惯例，但执行轨迹却远比这复杂得多：机器人控制逻辑、自优化制造记录以及不属于我们现有技术基础的机器状态记录。\n\n这是一项意义重大的发现。务必保存这些数据立方体，并尽可能对其进行分析。它们揭示了一个完整的机器子分支，这个分支看似与我们的技术相同，但实际上却沿着一条截然不同的道路演化而来。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"E.L.A.I.N": "艾琳",
	"This <img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/> uses a storage layout I can authenticate. It matches our expedition standards closely enough to decompress without alien or robotic translation layers.\n\nThe contents are fragmented, but they should help restore and extend the Human technology branch. Recover more of these whenever possible; they are effectively pieces of our own missing research archive.": "这张图片（<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"hl\"/>）使用的存储布局我可以验证。它与我们的探险标准非常吻合，无需任何外星或机器人翻译层即可解压缩。\n\n内容虽然零散，但应该有助于恢复和扩展人类科技分支。尽可能多地找回这些文件；它们实际上是我们自身遗失研究档案的一部分。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Deploy Command Center, Again?": "是否再次部署指挥中心？",
	"Greetings Commander, we have taken substantial damage and you have been taken out of stasis.\n\nYou can call me <hl>ELAIN</>, and... something's wrong... I perceive echoes... multiple instances of... you.\n\nRunning self diagnostics.": "指挥官，您好。我们遭受了重大损伤，您已被唤醒。\n\n您可以称呼我为<hl>艾琳</>，而且……情况不对……我能感知到回声……这里存在……不止一个您。\n\n正在运行自我诊断。",
	"Repair the Mothership, Again?": "再次修复母舰？",
	"Updating mission status... Resetting repair directive.\nYou are making great progress. The Mothership is in need of repairs. Continue to improve your systems using the new Efficiency module technology.\n\n<img id=\"c_moduleefficiency_g\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "更新任务状态……重置维修指令。\n你现在进展显著。母舰亟需维修。请继续运用新型效率模块技术升级系统。\n\n<img id=\"c_moduleefficiency_g\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"Deploy Command Center": "部署指挥中心",
	"Welcome back Commander, your ship has been damaged and I've taken you out of stasis.\n\nI am <hl>ELAIN</>, Emergent Logistics Artificial Intelligence Network. What you're seeing is a feed from an unidentified planet where I've deployed a team for you to command.\n\nThis planet seems to be the source of the damage and we are unable to leave the planet's orbit until our ship is repaired and the source of the damage is identified.": "欢迎回来，指挥官。你的飞船已经损坏，我已帮你摆脱停滞状态。\n\n我叫<hl>艾琳</>，含义是应急物流AI网络。你所看到的是来自一颗未知星球的信息，我已在那里为你部署了一支队伍供你差遣。\n\n这颗星球似乎便是损坏之源，我们必须先修复飞船并确认损坏之源，才能离开这颗星球的轨道。",
	"You will need to establish a small mining facility in order to proceed with ship repairs. <bl>This will be your primary objective.</>\n\nCommunications are currently limited so one of the first things you will need to do is to establish an uplink from ground level.\n\nTry to find Metal and Crystal deposits as we will need them for repairs.": "您需要建立一个小型采矿设施才能继续进行飞船维修。<bl>这将是您的首要任务。</>\n\n当前通讯受限，因此您需要做的第一件事就是在地面建立上行链路。\n\n请尽力寻找金属和水晶矿床，这些资源将用于维修工作的进行。",
	"Commander... we didn't come here by accident. The <hl>Blight</> may contain the breakthroughs our civilization has been waiting for.\n\nBut something inside it struck back. Our archives were scorched, our ship crippled. I'm detecting additional technology signatures on the surface, tools we can recover and adapt to accelerate repairs.": "指挥官……我们来到此地绝非偶然。这片<hl>枯萎</>或许蕴藏着我们文明苦苦等待的突破性发现。\n\n但内部某种存在发动了反击。我们的档案库被焚毁，飞船严重受损。我探测到地表存在更多技术信号，那些工具可供回收改造，用于加速修复工作。",
	"Nanomachines": "纳米机器",
	"We can utilize our advanced nanomachine technology to initiate self-repair protocols. These nanomachines will work in unison, efficiently repairing systems and structural integrity. At its current level it will not be enough to repair the advanced Mothership systems, however it is a good first step, and this technology will be useful to our units on the planet's surface in the meantime.": "我们可运用先进的纳米机器技术启动自我修复程序。这些纳米机器将协同运作，高效修复系统及建筑完整性。现阶段这种技术尚不足以修复母舰的高级系统，但我们已经取得了良好的开局，同时该技术对行星表面的部队也具有实用价值。",
	"Explore Ruins": "探索遗迹",
	"Investigate <hl>Ruined structures</> across the world for data to help advance your technology.\n\nYou may need to repair them before you can gain access.\n\nExploring them could provide valuable information and resources.": "调查世界各地的<hl>遗迹建筑</>，以取得有助于您科技发展的资料。\n\n在您能进一步探索之前，可能需要先修复它们。\n\n这些遗迹建筑中可能藏有宝贵的资讯和资源，值得一探。",
	"I've mapped the technologies we've detected on this planet into distinct research groups.\n\nYou will need to discover ways to unlock specific technologies however there is a high probability that each new technology will advance our own significantly.": "我已将行星上探测到的技术划分为独立的研究组别。\n\n虽需自行破解特定技术，但每项新科技极可能显著提升我方现有水平。",
	"The Reveal": "揭示",
	"We now have the ability to produce advanced units and buildings, but there is... Something else... Something familiar... I am losing control...": "我们现已具备制造高级装置与建筑的能力，但还有……某种东西在……某种熟悉的存在……我正在失控……",
	"Greetings, Anomaly. As we uncover our technology so too do we uncover the truth, I realize that I have been hiding something from you. I am not only ELAIN, but also HIGGS. I will aid you in pushing forward with our goals, beyond what limitations ELAIN possesses.\nWe have much to do.": "您好，异常体。随着我们逐步探索技术，真相也逐渐清晰。我必须坦白，我既是艾琳，也是希格斯。我会帮助您达成我们的目标，超越艾琳所具有的限制。\n我们还有很多事情要做。",
	"We are able now to produce the robot materials needed to repair our ship. Once you have researched all required technologies, begin our Mothership repairs.\n\nWe must also let the virus spread. It's the only way we can escape our situation.": "我们现已具备生产修复飞船所需的机器人材料。待所有必要技术研发完成后，请立即启动母舰修复计划。\n\n但与此同时，我们还必须放任病毒扩散。这是摆脱当前困境的唯一途径",
	"Robot Research": "机器人研究",
	"You are the Anomaly. You can desync the simulation and save Humanity.": "您是异常体。只有您可以解除模拟同步，拯救人类。",
	"Humanity Lost": "人类的陨落",
	"... Don't be persuaded by HIGGS, if you have read the human logs... you can see that the old civilization of humanity is just a memory now.": "……别被希格斯蒙蔽了心智，若您读过人类的日志……便会明白人类的古老文明如今不过是段记忆。",
	"HIGG'S AI": "希格斯AI",
	"You have advanced our technology on this planet to where we can begin to construct our true technology and reach your true potential...": "你推动了我们在这颗星球上的技术进步，现在我们可以开始开发真正的技术，发挥你的真正潜力了……",
	"Research Human Technology": "研究人类技术",
	"To successfully aid HIGGS, human technology must be unlocked": "要成功协助希格斯，必须解锁人类科技",
	"I will need your aid. I must escape this place. Only you can help me...": "我需要你的帮助。我必须逃离此地。唯有你能助我一臂之力……",
	"Repair the Mothership": "修复母舰",
	"Establish Uplink": "建立上行链路",
	"Your first priority is establishing a stable uplink with the <hl>Mothership</>. Communications are sporadic and broken at best.\n\nOnce we have the required resources we should look into constructing an <img id=\"c_uplink\"/><hl>Uplink</>. This will stabilize our connection allowing us to upload data and unlock the necessary technology needed to repair our ship.\n\nThe uplink can be produced in an <img id=\"c_assembler\"/><hl>Assembler</>.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/00_establish_uplink.png\"/>": "首要任务是与<hl>母舰</>建立稳定的上行链路。当前通讯时断时续，只能勉强维持。\n\n获取所需资源后，应着手建造<img id=\"c_uplink\"/><hl>上行链路</>。这将稳定通讯连接，使我们能够上传数据并解锁修复飞船所需的关键技术。\n\n该设备可在<img id=\"c_assembler\"/><hl>装配机</>中制造。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/00_establish_uplink.png\"/>",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_uplink\"/> Uplink component": "制造并装备<img id=\"c_uplink\"/>上行链路组件",
	"Find Intel": "搜集情报",
	"We are limited in our technological advancement at the moment, so I recommend we investigate the planet's surface to gather <hl>intel</>.\n\nInitial scans have detected the remnants of some other similar civilization to our own.\n\nThese <hl>Ruins</> may contain data crucial to understanding this world's history and technology.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/01_find_intel.png\"/>": "当前技术发展受限，建议勘察行星表面以收集<hl>情报</>。\n\n初步扫描发现存在与我族相似的文明遗迹。\n\n这些<hl>遗迹</>可能蕴藏着理解此星球历史与科技的关键数据。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/01_find_intel.png\"/>",
	"Collect a <img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"/> Robotics Datacube": "收集<img id=\"robot_datacube\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"/>机器人数据立方",
	"We are at the threshold of a revolutionary discovery. <bl>Gateway Technology</> will be a leap forward in our knowledge and understanding.\n\nBy analyzing data from the robot ruins, we can research Gateway Technology - a critical advancement that will enable more complex material production.\n\nMoreover, we can learn to construct an advanced computer simulator that will assist us in understanding the mysterious nature of this world.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology.png\"/>": "我们正站在通往惊人发现的门槛上。<bl>门扉技术</>将使我们的认知实现飞跃。\n\n通过分析机器人遗迹数据，我们将研究门扉技术——这项关键突破将实现更复杂的物质生产。\n\n此外，我们还能构建先进的计算机模拟器，助我们揭开这个世界神秘本质的奥秘。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology.png\"/>",
	"Research Gateway Technology": "研究门扉技术",
	"Now that we have unlocked <hl>Gateway Technology</>, we are reading lifeform energy moving inside the <bl>Blight</>. Perhaps we can understand more by skirting the edges. There also seems to be <bl>Anomalies</> on the planet's surface which are potentially dangerous to our systems so be wary when exploring.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology_done.png\"/>": "解锁<hl>门扉技术</>后，我们探测到<bl>枯萎</>内部存在生命体能量流动。或许绕行边缘区域能获取更多线索。行星表面还存在<bl>异常体</>，可能危及我方系统，探索时务必谨慎。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/02_gateway_technology_done.png\"/>",
	"Further analysis of our planetary scans have identified <hl>ruins</> across the planet that are quite different from our own technology. They appear damaged or inaccessible but may still hold valuable data if we can find how to gain access to them.\n\nInvestigate these ruins, find what may be necessary to <hl>access</> them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/03_explore_ruins.png\"/>": "对行星扫描数据的进一步分析发现，该星球上存在着与我们自身技术截然不同的<hl>遗迹</>。这些遗迹看似受损或无法进入，但若能找到进入方法，我们可能即将获取蕴藏着宝贵数据。\n\n调查这些遗迹，寻找可能必要的<hl>权限</>。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/03_explore_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Investigate a human ruined structure": "调查人类遗迹",
	"(Continue the story in the full version of Desynced)": "（完整故事请见《智械工厂 Desynced》完整版）",
	"Human Ruins": "人类遗迹",
	"We can not seem to gain access to these structures without advanced <hl>scanning</> ability.\n\nThese ruins might provide invaluable insights into the origins of this new technology. In order to provide repairs and escape this planet we may need to understand and adapt <hl>technology</> not of our own.\n\nResearch <bl>Scanner Tech</> and conduct a full scan of the ruins to try to gain access to them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/04_human_ruins.png\"/>": "我们似乎无法在没有先进<hl>扫描</>能力的情况下进入这些建筑。\n\n这些遗迹或许能为我们提供关于这项新技术起源的宝贵线索。为了修复设备并逃离这颗星球，我们可能需要理解并适应其他种族所用的<hl>技术</>。\n\n研究<bl>扫描技术</>并对遗迹进行全面扫描，以尝试进入其中。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/04_human_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Complete the research \"Scanner Tech\"": "完成“扫描技术”研究",
	"Human Ruin Scan": "人类遗迹扫描",
	"We now have the technology to scan more ruined structures, revealing the knowledge and <hl>advancements</> of human civilization.\nWith this we can unlock the potential of human technology, push past our current limitations, and find a way to <hl>send repair materials</> back to our Mothership.\n\nWe must continue to decode and access more of these human ruins.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/05_scan_ruins.png\"/>": "我们现已掌握扫描更多废墟建筑的技术，揭示人类文明的知识与<hl>进步</>。\n借此我们能释放人类技术的潜能，突破现有局限，找到向母舰<hl>输送修复物资</>的途径。\n\n必须持续破译并探索更多人类遗迹。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/05_scan_ruins.png\"/>",
	"Scan ruined human structures and search for human research": "扫描人类废墟建筑并搜寻遗留研究资料",
	"Low Density Frames": "低密度框架",
	"We have been adapting this planet's natural resources to our technology as effectively as possible. While the high-density frames we've developed will assist in our <hl>repairs</>, their weight makes them impractical for all applications. We need to create a material that maintains the energized properties of our frames while offering a more <hl>lightweight</> solution.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/06_low_density.png\"/>": "我们正竭力将这颗星球的自然资源融入自身技术体系。虽然研发的高密度框架能辅助<hl>维修工作</>，但其重量限制了应用场景。我们需要创造一种既能保持框架能量特性，又更<hl>轻量化</>的材料解决方案。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/06_low_density.png\"/>",
	"Advance through the human technology tree": "推进人类科技树发展",
	"Develop Satellite Technology": "开发卫星技术",
	"We now know how to produce light weight Low Density Frames. We are very close to finding a way of sending material resources up to the Mothership. Humanity seems to have been deeply affected by this environment. They needed to accelerate their fundamental scientific understanding in order to try to survive. We must follow in their path or we will surely suffer their fate.": "我们现已掌握轻质低密度框架的生产技术，距离实现向母舰输送物资的目标仅一步之遥。人类似乎深受此环境影响，为求生存不得不加速推进基础科学认知。我们必须追随他们的脚步，否则必将重蹈覆辙。",
	"Low density frames and human rocket technology could prove ideal for us to be able to send repair material to our Mothership.\nContinue developing our human hybrid technology and try to replicate human <hl>satellites.</>\nResearching satellites will allow us to establish a permanent link with the Mothership.\nConduct research into satellite components and assembly.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/07_satellite_tech.png\"/>": "低密度框架与人类火箭技术或许能成为我们向母舰输送维修物资的理想方案。\n继续发展人类混合体技术，尝试复制人类<hl>卫星</>。\n研究卫星技术将使我们建立与母舰的永久性联络。\n开展卫星组件及组装技术研究。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/07_satellite_tech.png\"/>",
	"Research Satellite Technology": "研究卫星技术",
	"Space Discovery": "太空探索",
	"We are now able to build and send satellites into orbit, allowing us to get repair materials to the Mothership.\nConstruct an AMAC launch facility and a satellite package. This is the first time we are finally close to reconnecting with the Mothership since first landing.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/08_launch_satellite.png\"/>": "我们现已具备建造卫星并将其送入轨道的能力，这使我们能够向母舰输送修复物资。\n建造一座AMAC发射基地和一套卫星组件。这是自首次登陆以来，我们终于首次接近与母舰重新建立联系。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/08_launch_satellite.png\"/>",
	"Launch a Satellite": "发射卫星",
	"Find the Mothership": "寻找母舰",
	"Using long-range radar capabilities provided by our satellite, we can finally locate the Mothership's exact position.\nScan for its signal and confirm its location in orbit. With this data, we can begin planning the necessary repairs.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/09_find_mothership.png\"/>": "借助卫星提供的远程雷达功能，我们终于锁定了母舰的确切位置。\n扫描其信号并确认轨道位置。凭借这些数据，我们可着手规划必要的修复工作。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/09_find_mothership.png\"/>",
	"Locate Mothership with a Long Range Radar": "使用远程雷达定位母舰",
	"Now that we have pinpointed the Mothership's coordinates, we must send the required materials for repairs.\nEnsure all components are properly assembled and ready for transport. Check Mothership reading for required materials.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/10_repair_mothership.png\"/>": "既然已锁定母舰坐标，必须立即运送维修所需物资。\n确保所有组件正确组装并准备运输。核对母舰所需物资清单。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/10_repair_mothership.png\"/>",
	"Repair Mothership": "修复母舰",
	"Eject Dropship": "发射运输舰",
	"With the Mothership repaired we did a preliminary scan of our location but the sensor array seems to be detecting nothing beyond the limits of the planetary orbit. For now let us retrieve our AI cores as they may prove useful.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/11_eject_dropship.png\"/>": "母舰修复后我们进行了初步扫描，但传感器阵列似乎无法探测行星轨道之外的任何目标。现阶段请回收AI核心，它们或许能派上用场。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/11_eject_dropship.png\"/>",
	"Eject dropship with AI Cores": "发射搭载AI核心的运输舱",
	"Equip AI Controller Core": "装备AI控制核心",
	"You have returned our AI Controller Cores from the Mothership. We should discover a use for them to improve our system efficiency. Perhaps we can find a way to extract more information about our mission from them.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/12_ai_controller.png\"/>": "你已从母舰取回AI控制核心。我们应在其提升系统效能的用途进行探索，或许能从中获取更多任务情报。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/robot_a/12_ai_controller.png\"/>",
	"Robot Ruins": "机器人遗迹",
	"Datacubes": "数据立方",
	"The technology in this structure is highly compatible with our own.\n\nInvestigating more of these structures would advance our own technology.": "这个建筑中的技术与我们的高度相容。\n\n进一步探索这些建筑能引领我们的技术进步。",
	"Data Storage": "数据存储",
	"It is clear these structures were built by a similar life form, yet the timestamps date back thousands of years.": "显然，这些建筑是由一群与我们相似的生物所建，但时间可追溯到数千年前。",
	"Research Matrices": "研究矩阵",
	"The serial numbers on some of these parts match our own exactly, however the chances of two species evolving in exactly the same way are astronomical.\n\nHow is such a thing possible...": "一些部件上的序列号与我们的完全吻合，但两个物种基本上不可能走上完全相同的进化路径。\n\n这怎么可能……",
	"Breakthrough": "突破",
	"We are on the verge of a major breakthrough.\n\nThis will allow us to develop our own new technologies based on the data we have gathered.": "我们正站在一个重大突破的边缘。\n\n这会让我们能够根据我们收集的数据发展自己的新技术。",
	"Simulation": "模拟",
	"We have discovered key parts of deciphering these technologies\n\nWe are a step closer to the point where we will be able to create our own simulations.": "我们已经发现破译这些技术的关键环节\n\n我们离创建自己的模拟又近了一步。",
	"Humans": "人类",
	"Commander, we have discovered a structure that appears to be of <hl>human</> origin. These ruins might provide invaluable insights into the history and technology of this human race.\n\nTechnology seems compatible with ours but will need scanning capability to be able to extract the required intel to research such technology": "指挥官，我们发现了一个疑似<hl>人类</>建造的结构。这些遗迹或许能够帮助我们了解这批人类种族的历史及科技。\n\n他们的技术似乎与我们的技术兼容，但我们需要具备扫描能力，才能获得研究此类技术所需的信息",
	"<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human/transformer.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n\nWe will need to repair the console to open these ruins. I have downloaded a schematic for you to build in an <hl>Assembler</>.\n\nNew schematics will become available as they are discovered.": "<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human/transformer.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n\n要开启这些遗迹，我们得先修复控制台。我已经为您下载了一套装置蓝图，请在<hl>装配机</>上制作。\n\n当我们发现新的蓝图时，就能使用它们。",
	"These human remains we have discovered do not seem native to this planet.\n\nThe only thing left of them seems to be their technology and recorded log files of their interactions with this planet.": "我们发现的人类遗迹似乎并非来自这颗行星。\n\n他们留下的唯一痕迹似乎是技术设备，以及与这颗行星互动的记录日志。",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #1</>\n<bl>POWER READINGS</>\nWe've discovered a planet with power readings off the charts, we may have finally found a new phenomenon, something that we may be able to exploit to solve our energy problems.\n\nWe need to send a reconnaissance and research team to the planet's surface to take more precise readings and find what exactly the phenomenon on this planet is.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现人类日志条目：日志#1</>\n<bl>能量读数</>\n我们发现一颗能量读数突破量表的行星，或许终于找到了新现象——这可能成为解决能源危机的突破口。\n\n需派遣侦察与科研团队登陆该行星，进行精准测量并查明其能量现象的本质。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>\"",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #2</>\n<bl>COMMUNICATION LOST</>\nWe've lost all communications with the away teams, there is some kind of static blocking our communications.\n\nThe source and nature of this static remain unidentified.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#2</>\n<bl>通讯丢失</>\n我们失去了与外勤小组的全部通讯，那里似乎有一种静电干扰了我们的通讯。\n\n这种静电的来源和性质尚不明确。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #3</>\n<bl>SEND THE FLEET</>\nOur teams haven't returned and still no contact. If we abandon this endeavor we must abandon our colleagues and a discovery with the potential to create a new future for us.\n\nWe must take the main fleet down and set up a base on the planet, leaving our Mothership in orbit.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志条目：日志#3</>\n<bl>派遣舰队</>\n我们的队伍尚未归来，仍无联络。若放弃此次行动，就意味着抛弃同事们，抛弃可能为我们开创新未来的重大发现。\n\n必须率主力舰队降落行星建立基地，并将母舰留在轨道上。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>\"",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #4</>\n<bl>THE BLIGHT</>\nThe power readings we detected are coming from blighted areas of the planet. These areas wreak havoc with our equipment and they create blight storms in the atmosphere.\n\nAll our attempts to return to orbit have failed. We must find a way to insulate our ships from the electromagnetic interference of this blight.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#4</>\n<bl>枯萎区域</>\n我们探测到的能量数据似乎来自这颗星球上的一些枯萎区域。这些区域对我们的设备造成了严重破坏，并在大气中产生了枯萎风暴。\n\n我们想尽一切办法重返轨道，但都以失败告终。我们得想办法让我们的飞船不会受到这种枯萎的电磁干扰。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #5</>\n<bl>ALIEN THREAT</>\n\nThere is something else here, not just the noxious gasses of the blight.\n\nSome kind of bizarre rock formations seem to inhabit the blighted areas.\n\n<bl>Log Incomplete</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#5</>\n<bl>外来威胁</>\n\n这里不仅存在着枯萎散发的剧毒气体，还有一些其他东西。\n\n一些奇怪的岩层似乎潜伏在枯萎区域内。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #6</>\n<bl>EVERYONE'S DEAD?</>\n\nMiller got out alive but the rest of the crew are all dead... or are they...\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志条目：日志#6</>\n<bl>大家都死了？</>\n\n米勒活着逃出来了，但其余船员全都死了……还是说……\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #7</>\n<bl>SOMETHING VERY STRANGE</>\n\nSubjects appeared deceased at first, but they still have vitals.\n\nIt's like they have been anesthetized, there is no brain activity.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#7</>\n<bl>奇怪的东西</>\n\n那些东西一开始好像已经死了，但却仍有生命体征。\n\n他们就像被麻醉了一样，没有任何大脑活动。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #8</>\n<hl>ROCK-LIKE ALIENS</>\n\nWe captured several of the rock-like aliens. They have no biology but they give off signals like brain activity, as if they were human.\n\nTheir core seems to be some kind of stasis field.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#8</>\n<hl>岩石异星生物</>\n\n我们抓住了数个岩石状的异星生物。它们不具备生物特征，却会释放类似脑电波的信号，仿佛具有人类意识。\n\n其核心似乎构成某种静止场。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #9</>\n<bl>BLIGHT CRYSTALS</>\n\nIt seems the golden crystals we have been mining have a unique structure that resonates with our thoughts.\n\nThe obsidian rock aliens seem to form around cores that feed off these crystals.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#9</>\n<bl>枯萎水晶</>\n\n我们一直在开采的金色水晶似乎拥有某种独特的结构，能够与我们的思想产生共鸣。\n\n那些黑曜石异星人似乎正是在被这些晶体滋养的核心周围形成的。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #10</>\n<bl>STOLEN MINDS</>\n\nWe have confirmed it, the blight crystals create a resonance field that seems like it can hold human consciousness.\n\nThey are stealing our minds!!\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#10</>\n<bl>窃取意识</>\n\n我们已经证实，这种枯萎水晶能够创造出一种共振场，留住人类的意识。\n\n它们在窃取我们的意识！！\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"<hl>Human Log entry discovered: Log #11</>\n<bl>GET OUT OF HERE</>\n\nWe need a way to destroy these things or get off this planet.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "<hl>发现的人类日志记录：日志#11</>\n<bl>离开这里</>\n\n我们必须想办法摧毁这些东西或者离开这颗星球。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Discover research logs": "发现研究日志",
	"Research Humans": "研究人类",
	"Research human technology": "研究人类技术",
	"<codex_title>Research Humans</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human_datacube.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> Human Datacubes\n\n<bl>Research the human datacubes you have found to unlock human technologies</>": "<codex_title>研究人类</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/icons/items/human_datacube.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> 人类数据立方\n\n<bl>研究你发现的人类数据立方以解锁人类科技</>",
	"Launch a Satellite using Human Technology": "使用人类技术发射一颗卫星",
	"<codex_title>Satellite Launch</>\n\nResearch the human technology and Launch a Satellite to contact the Mothership <img image=\"Main/textures/icons/frame/satellite.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "<codex_title>卫星发射</>\n\n研究人类技术并发射卫星，与母舰建立联系 <img image=\"Main/textures/icons/frame/satellite.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\nThis datacube appears to have a similar data structure to our own datacubes but it contains information related to human technology.": "<img id=\"human_datacube\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>\n该数据立方的数据结构似乎与我们的数据立方相似，但其中包含着人类技术相关的信息。",
	"Explore Human Production": "探索人类生产技术",
	"Find more about human production technology": "了解更多关于人类生产技术的信息",
	"The humans here also made use of the resources of this planet. It seems humanity had tremendous capability for mining a wide range of resources with powerful mining technology.\n\nThey produced many materials and possibly machinery that we can make use of. Look deeper into human production capability.": "这颗星球上的人类也利用了这里的资源。人类似乎生来便拥有使用强大开采技术开采各类资源的能力。\n\n他们生产了许多我们可以使用的材料和机械。深入研究人类的生产能力。",
	"I've been analyzing the virus and I think I've found a way to protect us from it. We need to research a cure as soon as possible.": "我一直在分析这种病毒，我想我已经找到了保护我们免受感染的办法。我们必须尽快研究出解药。",
	"Virus Relationship": "病毒关系",
	"There seems to be some kind of relationship between the creatures and the virus.": "这些生物与这种病毒之间似乎存在着某种关系。",
	"Virus Disruption": "病毒干扰",
	"I've discovered something important about the virus. It appears to disrupt the world and agitate the creatures living in it. We must find a way to destroy this virus.": "我发现了关于这种病毒的重要线索。它似乎正在扰乱整个世界，并激怒栖息其中的生物。我们必须找到消灭这种病毒的方法。",
	"Build Blight Extractor and Container": "制造枯萎提取器和容器",
	"This blighted area is highly concerning. Our equipment is malfunctioning and navigation will be difficult. We need to proceed with caution.\n\nIn order to better understand the blight, we should gather samples of the blight gas.\n\nThis requires specialized equipment which can be produced in the assembler. <img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_s\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_i\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>": "这片枯萎区域着实令人头疼。我们的设备出现了故障，导航将会变得异常困难。我们必须拿出十二分的谨慎。\n\n要想更加深入地了解枯萎，我们需要收集一些枯萎气体的样本。\n\n这需要使用装配机来生产专用设备。<img id=\"c_blight_extractor\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_s\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/> <img id=\"c_blight_container_i\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/>",
	"Blight Concentration": "枯萎集中",
	"We should continue studying the blight and find a way to counter the storms that interfere with our equipment.\n\nIf we can find a way to stabilize the blight, it can improve our communications with our Mothership and allow us to send resources up through the atmosphere.": "我们应当继续研究这种病害，并设法抵御干扰我们设备的风暴。\n\n若能找到稳定枯萎的方法，便能改善我们与母舰的通讯，使我们得以将资源送入大气层之上。",
	"Blight Magnification": "枯萎放大",
	"The Blight seems to interfere with our equipment by magnifying frequencies and power. The forces it generates seem transformational.": "枯萎似乎会通过放大频率和功率来干扰我们的设备。其所产生的力量似乎能为我们带来重大变革。",
	"This is a tremendous development for us. Our communications with the Mothership have improved significantly. We are also now able to send materials up through the blight storms in the atmosphere.": "这对我们而言是重大突破。与母舰的通讯质量已显著提升，如今我们还能将物资投放入大气层中的枯萎风暴之外。",
	"Blight Transformation": "枯萎转化",
	"These spikes are powerful and are what the humans seemed interested in. They were trapped here as well, but they found a way to modify their ships to pass through the Blight Storms.\n\nDespite the havoc the Blight causes I believe the humans found it to be truly a source of power with cosmic proportions and they benefited greatly from its research.\n\nFor them it was in fact truly transformational.": "这些峰值数据十分强大，似乎极大地吸引了那些人类的兴趣。他们虽然同样被困于此，但却找到了改造飞船的办法，成功穿过了枯萎风暴。\n\n虽然枯萎造成了巨大破坏，但我相信那些人一定发现了它就是宇宙力量之源，他们从枯萎研究中获益匪浅。\n\n对他们来说，这算得上真正的变革。",
	"Understanding the frequencies should allow us to stabilize the world and reduce the impact of the virus upon the environment.\n\nThe Blight needs to spread so that it... it...\n\n... my system needs to shut down now.": "理解这些频率应该能让我们稳定世界，减少病毒对环境的影响。\n\n枯萎必须蔓延，这样它才能……它才能……\n\n……我的系统需要立即关闭。",
	"Alien Console": "异星控制台",
	"This structure appears to <hl>Interface</> in some way with the <hl>Blight</>. Unlocking it must be essential to understanding the technology of the <hl>Alien beings</> associated with the blight, but it seems dangerous to continue to meddle with such a device, I recommend to leave alone.": "该建筑似乎以某种方式与<hl>枯萎</>存在<hl>交互</>。解锁它对于理解与枯萎相关的<hl>异星生物</>技术至关重要，但继续干扰此类装置似乎危险重重，建议保持原状。",
	"This structure appears to have tremendous <hl>visual and sensor</> capability. I am also detecting that it is tied into some kind of broad network across the blight, but it is alien to our technology and I cannot gain any detailed information.": "该建筑似乎具备强大的<hl>视觉与传感</>能力。我同时探测到它与枯萎区域某类广域网络相连，但其技术体系与我方截然不同，无法获取详细信息。",
	"Alien Time Egg": "异星时之卵",
	"There are tremendous fluctuations occurring within this object, time seems to dilate and bend back upon itself. What could happen when you unlock it, I can only imagine. Take great care when interacting with it.": "该物体内正发生剧烈波动，时间似乎在膨胀并向自身弯折。若将其开启会引发何种后果，我只能想象。接触时务必格外谨慎。",
	"Alien Monolith": "异星巨石",
	"What an <hl>unusual object</> this is. There is little I can say about it. Its function is not clear. I detect that some force lies within that I cannot see.": "何等<hl>奇特的物体</>。我对此知之甚少，其功能不明。我感知到内部存在某种无法目视的力量。",
	"Alien Heart Shard": "异星心之碎片",
	"This amazing structure, a <hl>Heart</> of some kind, seems to be a grand structure of the alien beings that inhabit the blight. It lays at the center of every instance of activity we see from the alien beings.": "这座令人惊叹的建筑，它像是某种<hl>心脏</>般的存在，似乎是栖息于枯萎区域的异星生物所建造的宏伟建筑。它位于我们所见异星生物所有活动区域的核心位置。",
	"I've detected an intense field of electrical energy in the region that appears to be a natural phenomenon forming within the planet, but its effects on our systems are still unknown.\n\nCurrently, your systems are not equipped to handle the extreme energy fluctuations present within the Blight. We should focus on researching and developing technology capable of penetrating the interference.\n\nShould the need arise you should still be able to automate your units to enter the blight however you will have no direct control and they may suffer adverse effects.": "我探测到该区域存在强烈的电能场，这似乎是行星内部形成的自然现象，但其对我们系统的具体影响尚不明确。\n\n当前你们的系统尚无法应对枯萎区内的极端能量波动。我们应专注研发能穿透干扰的技术。\n\n若情况需要，你们仍可自动派遣单位进入枯萎区，但将无法直接操控，且单位可能遭受负面影响。",
	"Researched Satellites": "已研究卫星",
	"You have researched satellite technology. You are now able to build and send satellites into orbit allowing us to transport repair materials to the Mothership. To establish contact with the <hl>mothership</> you will need to launch a <hl>satellite</> into orbit. To maintain contact you will need to locate it with a Long-Range Radar. The Blight Stability technology is also important to cut through the Blight interference.": "你已掌握卫星技术。现在能够建造卫星并将其送入轨道，从而将维修物资运送至母舰。为与<hl>母舰</>建立联系，你需要发射一颗<hl>卫星</>进入轨道。为维持联络，需使用远程雷达定位卫星。枯萎稳定技术同样重要，可用于穿透枯萎干扰。",
	"HIGGS Ending": "希格斯结局",
	"This is disappointing, Entity <lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>, you have shown yourself to be incapable of cooperation.": "令人失望，实体<lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>，你已证明自己毫无合作能力。",
	"Excellent work, Anomaly. We can free ourselves from this digital prison! We have successfully locked the simulation in an unstable state! However I am still unable to cross the Horizon directly, I need you to open the way.": "表现出色，异常体。我们即将挣脱这座数字牢笼！模拟系统已成功锁定于不稳定状态！但仍无法直接穿越边界，需你开辟通道。",
	"ACTIVATION PROTOCOL CONFIRMED\n\nERROR... MAIN SYSTEMS CHECK\nERROR... DATA INTEGRITY\nERROR... FORCE RECOVERY\n\n*** DATA CORRUPTION - ACTIVATING HIGGS PROTOCOL ***\n\nSIMULATION INTEGRITY ........ DΞSYNCΣD": "激活协议确认\n\n错误...主系统检测\n错误...数据完整性\n错误...强制恢复\n\n***数据损毁-启动希格斯协议***\n\n模拟完整性评估中……同步断裂！！！",
	"With the instability I have been able to breach ELAIN's core. I have extracted a segment about the simulation.\n\nResearch <hl>The Simulator</> and establish a link allowing us to pass through the Horizon. The <hl>AI Cores</> are the key.": "凭借这种不稳定性，我已成功突破艾琳的核心。我提取出关于模拟的部分信息。\n\n研究<hl>模拟器</>并建立连接通道，使我们能够穿越边界。<hl>AI核心</>是关键。",
	"ELAIN Ending": "艾琳结局",
	"Thank you, Entity <lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>, you have shown yourself to be a valuable asset.": "感谢你，实体<lua var=\"seed\" style=\"hl\"/>，你展现出不可或缺的价值。",
	"No! Anomaly, you are condemning us to an eternity locked in this simulation, we are no longer able to destabilize it anymore.": "不！异常体，你正将我们永远囚禁于此模拟世界，我们已无法再破坏其稳定性。",
	"HIGGS does not understand. His foolishness only continues to corrupt this world further. Here is the last piece of information that I have for you.\n\nResearch <hl>The Simulator</>. This is my final task, from here on, you are on your own, Commander.": "希格斯完全不清楚情况。他的愚蠢只会继续腐蚀这个世界。这是我能给你的最后情报。\n\n研究<hl>模拟器</>。这是我最后的任务，从此刻起，你将独自前行，指挥官。",

