	// FILE: Main/scenarios/freeplay/freeplay_tutorial.lua
	"Understood": "了解",
	"click anywhere to minimize": "点击任意位置最小化",
	"Click Understood to Continue": "点击“了解”继续",
	"Learn More: %s": "了解更多：%s",
	"id": "id",
	"learnmore": "了解更多",
	"<hl>Information</>\n\n<yl>></> Health - Click and hold the mouse button on it to deconstruct the selected unit or building.\n<yl>></> Battery - Hover the mouse for details on power consumption and production of this unit.": "<hl>信息</>\n\n<yl>></> 生命值 - 点击并按住鼠标按钮，可拆除选中的装置或建筑。\n<yl>></> 电池 - 将鼠标悬停其上，可查看该装置的能耗与生产详情。",
	"<hl>Logistics</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/power_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Power on/off</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Logistics settings</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>Transport route</>": "<hl>物流管理</>\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/power_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>电源开关</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button_ON.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>物流设置</>\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>  <bl>运输路线</>",
	"<hl>Inventory</>\n\nDuring gameplay you can right click inventory item slots for more options.": "<hl>库存</>\n\n游戏过程中可右键点击库存格位查看更多选项。",
	"<hl>Component Sockets</>\n\nSockets and components come in four sizes, <hl>internal</>, <hl>small</>, <hl>medium</> and <hl>large</>.": "<hl>组件插槽</>\n\n插槽与组件分为四种规格：<hl>内部</>、<hl>小型</>、<hl>中型</>及<hl>大型</>。",
	"<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/new/INTRODUCTION_codex_button_01.png\"/>\nThe <hl>Codex Button</> opens the in-game Codex which contains more in-depth information. The <hl>Navigation Buttons</> allow you to view previous codex entries.": "<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/new/INTRODUCTION_codex_button_01.png\"/>\n点击<hl>手册按钮</>可打开游戏内说明手册，查阅更深入的信息。通过<hl>导航按钮</>可浏览先前手册条目。",
	"<hl>Pan the Camera</> using the <Key axis=\"CameraY\" style=\"hl\"/> and <Key axis=\"CameraX\" style=\"hl\"/> keys\n\nor with <Key action=\"DragCamera\" style=\"hl\"/> and dragging.": "使用<Key axis=\"CameraY\" style=\"hl\"/>和<Key axis=\"CameraX\" style=\"hl\"/>键控制<hl>摄像机位置</>\n\n或通过<Key action=\"DragCamera\" style=\"hl\"/>键配合拖拽操作",
	"Pan the camera": "平移镜头",
	"Use the <Key axis=\"CameraZoom\" style=\"hl\"/> to <hl>Zoom</> the camera": "使用<Key axis=\"CameraZoom\" style=\"hl\"/>按钮<hl>缩放</>镜头",
	"Game Interface": "游戏界面",
	"Follow the prompts": "请遵循提示操作",
	"<img image=\"icon_small_energy\" color=\"ui_light\"/> Power <hl>production</> and <hl>consumption</> of your power grid.": "<img image=\"icon_small_energy\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 监控电网的<hl>发电量</>与<hl>耗电量</>。",
	"<img image=\"icon50_ItemNum\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>Available items</> are shown at the top of the screen.\n\nThis can be toggled or filtered by using the button to the left.": "<img image=\"icon50_ItemNum\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>可用物品</>显示于屏幕顶部。\n\n可通过左侧按钮切换或筛选显示内容。",
	"<img image=\"icon_tiny_day\" color=\"ui_light\"/><img image=\"icon_tiny_night\" color=\"ui_light\"/> <hl>Time indicators</> showing day/night, time of day and the date are shown here.\n\nButtons to <hl>pause</> the game and open the <hl>in-game menu</> are also here.": "<img image=\"icon_tiny_day\" color=\"ui_light\"/><img image=\"icon_tiny_night\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 此处显示<hl>时间指示器</>，包括昼夜状态、当前时间和日期。\n\n用于<hl>暂停</>游戏和打开<hl>游戏内菜单</>的按钮也位于此处。",
	"<img image=\"icon_remote\" color=\"ui_light\"/> An interactive <hl>minimap</>.\n\n<hl>Game notifications</> will appear underneath it. Various notification categories can be disabled in the options.": "<img image=\"icon_remote\" color=\"ui_light\"/> 交互式<hl>小地图</>。\n\n<hl>游戏通知</>将显示在其下方。",
	"Move a <hl>unit</> with <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>": "使用<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>移动<hl>装置</>",
	"Pressing <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> will make the <hl>selected units</> perform various actions based on what components are equipped.": "按下<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>将使<hl>选中装置</>根据装备组件执行不同操作。",
	"Drag the <img id=\"c_adv_portable_turret\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> onto your <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "将<img id=\"c_adv_portable_turret\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>拖拽至<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"<hl>Items</> can be moved by dragging them onto another unit on the map. <hl>Components</> will automatically get equipped when transferred.\nSelect your <img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to access its inventory": "<hl>物品</>可通过拖拽至地图上其他装置来移动。<hl>组件</>在运送时将自动装备。\n选择您的<img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>以访问其库存",
	"Deploy it using the <hl>[ Deploy Base ]</> button": "使用<hl>[部署基地]</>按钮进行部署",
	"Deploy the <img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> between the resources.\n<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_landingpod\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\"/>": "在资源区之间部署<img id=\"f_bot_2m_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_landingpod\"/> <img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\"/>",
	"The Network": "网络",
	"You have a <hl>network</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> which will handle basic <hl>logistics</> and supply <hl>power</> to units and buildings. Automated delivery of items will only happen inside the network.": "您拥有一个<hl>网络</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/network_button.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>，该网络将处理基础<hl>物流</>并为装置和建筑<hl>供电</>。物品的自动配送仅在网络内部进行。",
	"Toggle the <hl>logistics network</> overlay (<Key action=\"PowerInfo_Toggle\" style=\"hl\"/>)": "切换<hl>物流网络</>图层（<Key action=\"PowerInfo_Toggle\" style=\"hl\"/>）",
	"Deployable Building": "可部署建筑",
	"Drag the <img id=\"c_deployer\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> onto your <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "将<img id=\"c_deployer\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>拖拽至您的<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"You have been given a <hl>deployable building</>.\n\nSelect the <img id=\"f_spacedrop\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to access its inventory.": "您获得了一座<hl>可部署建筑</>。\n\n选择<img id=\"f_spacedrop\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>可访问其库存。",
	"Deploy production building": "部署生产建筑",
	"With the <img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> selected, click <hl>Deploy</> and place the building in an open area away from your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "选中<img id=\"f_bot_1s_as\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>后点击<hl>部署</>，将建筑放置于远离<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>的空旷区域。",
	"Start Mining": "开始开采",
	"Start mining <hl>Metal Ore</> and <hl>Crystal Chunks</>": "启动<hl>金属矿</>与<hl>晶体矿</>开采",
	"Set both <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/> to start mining, one on a <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\" style=\"hl\"/> and one on a <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\" style=\"hl\"/> using <Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>": "使用<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/>将两座<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/>分别设置为开采<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_metal\" style=\"hl\"/>和<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_resourcenode_crystal\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Equip Fabricator": "装配制造机",
	"Equip <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> in a medium socket": "在中型插槽中装备<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Select the <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> and drag the <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> from your inventory into a free <hl>medium socket</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/MSocket.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "选中<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，将<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>从库存拖拽至空闲的<hl>中型插槽</><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/MSocket.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Set the Command Center to produce <hl>3 Fabricators</>": "将指挥中心设置为生产<hl>3台制造机</>",
	"We'll expand production with more <hl>Fabricators</> for our production buildings. Components are required to be built separately.": "我们将通过增设更多<hl>制造机</>来扩充生产建筑的产能。组件需单独建造。",
	"Setting up Production": "生产配置",
	"Construct a <img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> using the <hl>build menu</> (<Key action=\"Build\" style=\"hl\"/>) <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/icon_build.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>": "通过<hl>建造菜单</>（<Key action=\"Build\" style=\"hl\"/>）构建<img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/icon_build.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>",
	"Automate production of <img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> by constructing a dedicated production building.": "建造专用生产建筑，启动自动化生产<img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Requesting Component": "请求组件",
	"Request a <img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "请求<img id=\"c_fabricator\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Select the new building and click the <hl>Request Item</> button <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/request_button.png\" color=\"ui_light\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> to request one <hl>Fabricator</>. Requests deliver existing items via the network.": "选中新建建筑并点击<hl>请求物品</>按钮<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/request_button.png\" color=\"ui_light\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>，以请求一个<hl>制造器</>。请求将通过物流网络完成。",
	"Set production to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>": "设置生产为<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Set the <hl>production</> register to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "将<hl>生产</>寄存器设置为<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalbar\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Duplicate a Building": "复制建筑",
	"Copy and paste a production building": "复制并粘贴生产建筑",
	"Copy an existing building by pressing <Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>. Move the mouse over an empty tile and activate the build cursor with the copied structure by pressing <Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>. Use <Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> to place a construction site.\n\nYou can always <hl>relocate</> buildings from the <hl>unit options</> menu.": "按下<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>复制现有建筑。将鼠标移至空格上，按下<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>激活带有复制建筑的建造光标。使用<Key action=\"SelectAction\"/>放置建筑场地。\n\n您可随时通过<hl>装置选项</>菜单<hl>迁移</>建筑。",
	"Edit and Place a Building": "编辑并放置建筑",
	"Place another building that produces <img id=\"metalplate\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "放置另一座生产<img id=\"metalplate\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>的建筑",
	"Copy one of the <img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> production buildings (<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>), put it in the build cursor (<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>), then use <hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\"/> to show the <hl>construction editor</>.\nSet the <hl>production</> register to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalplate\" style=\"hl\"/>.\n\nThis can also be used to <hl>upgrade</> existing buildings.": "复制其中一座<img id=\"metalbar\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>生产建筑（<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitCopy\"/>），将其置于建造光标（<Key style=\"hl\" action=\"UnitPaste\"/>）中，然后使用<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\"/>调出<hl>建造编辑器</>。\n将<hl>生产</>寄存器设置为<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"metalplate\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n此操作也可用于<hl>升级</>现有建筑。",
	"Produce two <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_carrier_bot\" style=\"hl\"/>": "生产两个<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_carrier_bot\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Use the <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_carrier_factory\" style=\"hl\"/> in your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to produce <hl>two</> more Runner bots.": "在你的<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>中使用<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_carrier_factory\" style=\"hl\"/>，生产<hl>两个</>额外的运输机器人。",
	"Advanced Production: Assembler": "进阶生产：装配机",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "生产并装备一个<img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"On your <img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> use the <img id=\"c_fabricator\" widht=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to produce an <img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "在你的<img id=\"f_landingpod\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>上使用<img id=\"c_fabricator\" widht=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，生产一个<img id=\"c_assembler\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"Equip an Uplink": "装备一个上行链路",
	"Produce and equip an <img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/> on your Command Center": "在你的指挥中心生产并装备一个<img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"An <img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/> is required to access your technology research tree.\n\nYou may need to unequip another component to make space for the uplink.": "访问您的科技树需要安装<img id=\"c_uplink\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" style=\"hl\"/>组件。\n\n您可能需要卸下其他组件以腾出空间安装上行链路。",
	"Research Basic Structures": "研究基础建筑",
	"Start research on <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_structures1\" style=\"hl\"/>": "开始研究<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_structures1\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Open the <hl>research window</> (<Key action=\"Tech\" style=\"hl\"/>) <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/techtree_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "打开<hl>研究窗口</>（<Key action=\"Tech\" style=\"hl\"/>）<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/techtree_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Build Storage and Set Store Location": "建造仓库并设定存储位置",
	"Build <hl>Storage Blocks</> and Set Both Engineer's <hl>Store register</>": "建造<hl>仓库区块</>，并为两位工程师分别设定<hl>寄存器</>",
	"Construct two <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> buildings.\n\nOn each of your <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/> set their <hl>Store</> <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/> register to tell them where to store their items.": "建造两座<img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>建筑。\n\n在每座建筑上<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"f_bot_1s_adw\" style=\"hl\"/>设置其<hl>存储</><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>寄存器，以告知他们物品的存储位置在何方。",
	"Expanding Production": "扩大生产",
	"Build Medium Production Building for <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>": "建造中型生产建筑用于<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"Construct a <img id=\"f_building2x1g\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>, then equip an <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_assembler\" style=\"hl\"/> and set its production to <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>.\n\nYou will need to produce the <hl>Assembler</> separately.": "建造一座<img id=\"f_building2x1g\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，然后装备<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"c_assembler\" style=\"hl\"/>并将它的生产设置为<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"reinforced_plate\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n需单独生产<hl>装配机</>。",
	"Advanced Materials: Circuit Boards": "进阶材料：电路板",
	"Start <img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> production": "启动<img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>生产",
	"Produce another building to produce <img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>.\nRemember you can use <hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\" style=\"hl\"/> to customize a building before placing it.": "建造另一座建筑以生产<img id=\"circuit_board\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n请注意：放置建筑前可使用<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"SelectAction\" style=\"hl\"/>自定义建筑。",
	"Research Basic Power": "研究基础能源",
	"Research the basic power technology": "研究基础能源技术",
	"Open <hl>Research</> and set <img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_power0\" style=\"hl\"/> as your research.": "打开<hl>研究</>并选择<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" id=\"t_power0\" style=\"hl\"/>作为研究目标。",
	"You will require more <hl>power</> to run more production. Power can be extracted from crystals to help you get started. More power options will become available later.": "提升产能需消耗更多<hl>电力</>。初期可通过开采晶体获取电力，后续将解锁更多电力获取途径。",
	"Equip a <img id=\"c_crystal_power\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> component on a building <img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>": "在建筑<img id=\"f_building1x1d\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>上装备<img id=\"c_crystal_power\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>组件",
	"Network Expansion": "网络扩展",
	"Place a building with a Small Power Field near the plateau": "在高原附近建造配备小型电场装置的建筑",
	"Produce and equip a <img id=\"c_small_relay\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> on a building near the <img id=\"f_resourcenode_silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> but still inside your <hl>network</>.": "生产并装备<img id=\"c_small_relay\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>组件至建筑，并将其放置在<img id=\"f_resourcenode_silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>附近（需位于<hl>网络</>范围内）。",
	"Mine Silica Sand": "开采硅砂",
	"Set a unit to mine <img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>": "派遣装置开采<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>",
	"<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> can be found on the plateau. You can build a <img id=\"f_bot_1s_a\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> unit with a <img id=\"c_miner\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> component to create a simple mining bot.": "<img id=\"silica\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 可在高原上找到。您可建造配备 <img id=\"c_miner\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> 组件的 <img id=\"f_bot_1s_a\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"hl\"/> 装置，从而创建简单的采矿机器人。",
	"Set up Transport Route": "设置运输路线",
	"Build a <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>, then select a <img id=\"f_carrier_bot\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> and activate its <hl>transport route</> button <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>.": "建造 <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 后，选中 <img id=\"f_carrier_bot\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> 并激活其 <hl>运输路线</> 按钮 <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/transport_route.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"/>。",
	"Build storage and turn on a runner's transport route": "建造仓库并开启运输机器人的运输路线",
	"Set the <hl>Goto</> register <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_goto.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/> of the runner to the unit mining silica to pick up from it.": "将运输机器人的<hl>前往</>寄存器<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_goto.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/>指向开采硅砂的装置，使其进行拾取。",
	"Set the <hl>Unit Mining Silica</> as the <hl>Goto</> point": "将<hl>开采硅砂的装置</>设为<hl>前往</>目标点",
	"Set up Transport Route 3": "设置运输路线3",
	"Set the <hl>Store</> register <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/> to the <img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> to drop off its items.": "将<hl>商店</>的寄存器<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/icons/register_store.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"/>设置为<img id=\"f_building1x1f\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，以卸下其物品。",
	"Set the <hl>Storage Unit</> as the <hl>Store</> location": "将<hl>存储装置</>设为<hl>存储</>位置。",
	"Congratulations": "恭喜",
	"Now that you have learnt the basics of base building you are ready to continue with your mission to <hl>repair the Mothership</>.\n\nThe tutorial begins in <hl>passive mode</> meaning the native population of bugs will not come out of their <img id=\"f_bug_hive\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> or <img id=\"f_bug_hole\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/> until you attack them.": "现在你已经掌握了基地建设的基础知识，可以继续执行<hl>修复母舰</>的任务了。\n\n教程以<hl>被动模式</>开始，这意味着虫族原住民不会主动离开他们的<img id=\"f_bug_hive\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>或<img id=\"f_bug_hole\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"hl\"/>，除非你主动攻击他们。",
	"<hl>Behaviors</> are an advanced mechanic for controlling units. To get started, add an <hl>Integrated Behavior</> to a unit via the <hl>unit options</> menu.\n\nMore information and story dialogue can be found in the <hl>Codex</> (<Key action=\"Codex\" style=\"hl\"/>).": "<hl>行为指令</>是控制单位的高级机制。初始操作需通过<hl>单位选项</>菜单为单位添加<hl>集成行为</>。\n\n更多信息及剧情对话详见<hl>手册</>（<Key action=\"Codex\" style=\"hl\"/>）。",
	"Continuation": "继续",
	"You can choose to continue to play this game or start a <hl>new game</> and customize many of the gameplay settings for your playstyle.\n\nGood luck, <hl>Commander</>!": "你可以选择继续游玩当前游戏，或开始<hl>新游戏</>并根据个人风格自定义多种游戏设置。\n\n祝你好运，<hl>指挥官</>！",

