	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/ai_base.lua
	"AI Base": "AI基地",
	"AI": "AI",
	"There appears to be an AI core controlling this base. To what purpose we cannot but sure. Let us monitor the situation before planning our next course of action.": "似乎有个AI核心在控制这座基地。其目的尚不明确。让我们先监控局势，再规划下一步行动。",
	"Observe the AI base": "观察AI基地",
	"AI Behaviors": "AI行为",
	"The AI Core at the heart of the base is an advanced version of our own Behavior Controllers. We should be able to modify them using similar means. With this new technology we will be able to set up fully automated remote bases.": "基地核心的AI系统是我们自主研发的行为控制器的升级版。我们应该能够采用类似方法对其进行改造。借助这项新技术，我们将能够建立完全自动化的远程基地。",
	"AI Behavior Controllers have been unlocked - End of Mission": "AI行为控制器已解锁 - 任务结束",
