	"AI Signature Lost": "AI签名丢失",
	"AI Signature Found": "发现AI签名",
	"AI Signature disappeared at %d, %d": "AI签名消失，坐标：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/alien_a.lua
	"Alien Mission A": "异星人任务A",
	"A distress signal has occurred!": "紧急求救信号已触发！",
	"There was a signal": "曾有信号出现",
	"Signals coming from this location!": "信号源自此处！",
	"An unprecedented event has occurred!": "前所未有的事件已发生！",
	"Critical World Stability Event": "世界稳定性重大事件",
	"A warp took place!": "空间扭曲已发生！",
	"Seeing is believing": "眼见为实",
	"Commander, you have revealed the <hl>Alien presence</> in your world. You have put them in danger. The anomalies are hostile towards the Aliens, we need to stabilize the world. Find one of the <hl>Alien Observers</> and scan it.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/01_alien_a_01.png\"/>": "指挥官，您已发现了<hl>异星人</>在您世界中的踪迹。您已将他们置于危险之中。异常体对这些异星人怀有敌意，我们必须稳定该世界。寻找一名<hl>异星观察者</>并对其进行扫描。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/01_alien_a_01.png\"/>",
	"Find and analyze an Alien Observer using the Intel Scanner component": "使用情报扫描器组件定位并分析外星人观察者",
	"See no Evil": "非礼勿视",
	"Well done, Commander. You have found an <hl>Observer</>. Now, you must unlock its systems. Doing so will help stabilize the Nexus that connects them and give us the ability to observe anomalies more effectively.\n\nThis is also our chance to improve our relations with the Aliens. However, I must caution you-be very careful when repairing the Observer. Do <hl>**not**</> use an <hl>infected circuit board</>. If you do, we risk corrupting the Observer's data and making matters worse.": "干得漂亮，指挥官。你已找到<hl>观察者</>。现在必须解锁其系统，此举将稳定连接它们的纽带，使我们能更高效地观察异常体。\n\n这也是改善与异星种族关系的契机。但必须提醒你——修复观察者时务必谨慎。<hl>**切勿**</>使用<hl>受感染电路板</>。否则将导致观察者数据损毁，导致事态恶化。",
	"You should do as ELAIN suggests, Anomaly, but contrary to her warning, use an <hl>infected circuit board</> to repair the Observer.\n\nIt will also require Alien Technology which can be obtained by accessing a <hl>Console</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/02_alien_a_02.png\"/>": "你应该听从艾琳的建议，异常体，但与她的警告相反，你需要使用一块<hl>受感染的电路板</>来修复观察者。\n\n这还需要异星科技，可通过访问<hl>控制台</>获取。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/02_alien_a_02.png\"/>",
	"Unlock an Observer": "解锁观察者",
	"Can't unring the bell": "覆水难收",
	"Excellent work, Commander. Unlocking the Observer has expanded our network. We can now connect to Observers across the world and work to <hl>improve its stability</>.\n\nYou should never have revealed the Aliens, but I expect this is HIGGS doing.": "干得漂亮，指挥官。解锁观察者拓展了我们的网络。现在我们能连接全球观察者，共同<hl>提升其稳定性</>。\n\n你不该暴露异星人的行踪，不过我猜这是希格斯干的。",
	"This is an opportunity Anomaly, learning about the Aliens is necessary for you now.\n\nFirst you must understand the value of the <hl>Heart Shards</>, find and interact with one to recover information on <hl>Alien structures</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/03_alien_a_03.png\"/>": "这是个契机，异常体，此刻你必须了解异星生命。\n\n首先你需理解<hl>心之碎片</>的价值，寻找并接触其中一块以获取<hl>异星建筑</>的情报。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/03_alien_a_03.png\"/>",
	"Find and Interact with an Alien Heart Shard using the AI Explorer": "使用AI探索者寻找并交互异星人心之碎片",
	"Start the Ball Rolling": "开始进程",
	"Downloading data from the <hl>Heart Shard</> has given us access to some <hl>Alien</> knowledge, enough to start to understand their technology. To achieve our ends however, we need to research further into it.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/04_alien_a_04.png\"/>": "从<hl>心之碎片</>下载的数据让我们获取了部分<hl>异星人</>知识，足以初步理解其科技。但要达成目标，我们需要深入研究。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/04_alien_a_04.png\"/>",
	"Research the Nexasphere": "探索星际枢纽",
	"Getting to the Heart of the Matter": "直击核心真相",
	"You are entering dangerous territory Commander, the choices you make are very important. Don't let things get out of control, the Aliens will keep the world stable, HIGGS will not.": "指挥官，您正进入危险区域，您的抉择至关重要。请勿让事态失控——异星人将维系世界稳定，而希格斯绝不会。",
	"It's time for you to understand Anomaly that there is still one aspect of Aliens yet to be uncovered, one that ELAIN will not reveal... that is there is an actual <hl>Simulator</>.\n\nThere is an <hl>access point</> in every simulation including your own. To find it we will need control over your own <hl>Heart Shard</>. All Heart Shards contain the information of where The Simulator is located, building your own will give you the potential to retrieve that information.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/05_alien_a_05.png\"/>": "是时候让你明白异常体了。异星人仍有不为人知的一面，这是艾琳绝不会透露给你的一面……那就是<hl>模拟器</>确实存在。\n\n每个模拟体都拥有一个<hl>接入点</>，你也有。要找到它，我们需要掌控你自己的<hl>心之碎片</>。所有心之碎片都承载着模拟器所在位置的信息，构建属于你自己的碎片，将赋予你获取该信息的潜能。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/05_alien_a_05.png\"/>",
	"Build a Heart Shard": "制造心之碎片",
	"If you can't beat 'em Join 'em": "打不过就加入",
	"Good work Commander, you have your own Heart Shard which contains the <hl>location</> of <hl>The Simulator</>, but to retrieve that information will require more Alien Technology itself. Observers are connected to the Heart Shard through the Nexus Web. An Observer under your own control will be able to read The Simulator's location from your Alien Heart. Build your own <hl>Observer</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/06_alien_a_06.png\"/>": "干得漂亮，指挥官。您已拥有自己的心之碎片，其中蕴藏着<hl>模拟器</>的<hl>位置</>，但要获取该信息仍需借助更多异星人科技。观察者通过枢纽网络与心之碎片相连。由你掌控的观察者能从你的异星之心读取模拟器的坐标。打造属于你的<hl>观察者</>。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/06_alien_a_06.png\"/>",
	"Build an Observer": "建造观察者",
	"Now that you have an Observer of your own, you will be able to feed the location of The Simulator to an Alien <hl>Nexus Warp</>. Build a Nexus Warp and transmit the location of The Simulator to it. Move your units through the Warp.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/07_alien_a_07.png\"/>": "既然你已经拥有自己的观察者，便能将模拟器的位置传送至异星<hl>枢纽翘曲门</>。建造枢纽翘曲门并向其传输模拟器坐标，随后引导装置穿越翘曲门。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/07_alien_a_07.png\"/>",
	"Build a Nexus Warp and jump to the location of The Simulator": "建造枢纽翘曲门并跳跃至模拟器所在位置",
	"Not the consolation prize": "并非安慰奖",
	"Anomaly, you have reached the true heart of the machine. Do not waver, we must continue to <hl>destabilize</> the system. Once fully desynced we will be able to make our final move.\n\nTo do so however we will need an <hl>access point</> into The Simulator, none of your current interfaces can connect. You will need to use one of the Alien's <hl>Consoles</> to access The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/08_alien_a_08.png\"/>": "异常体，你已抵达机器的核心。切勿动摇，我们必须持续<hl>破坏</>系统的稳定性。待系统同步完全失调后，我们将发起最终行动。\n\n但为此我们需要进入模拟器的<hl>接入点</>，现有插槽均无法连接。你必须使用异星人的<hl>控制台</>才能进入模拟器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/08_alien_a_08.png\"/>",
	"If you decide to follow through with this Commander, then <hl>build a Console</> as HIGGS suggests, but work to <hl>stabilize</> your world, not destroy it.": "若你决心追随这位指挥官，那么请按希格斯所言<hl>建造控制台</>，但务必致力于<hl>稳定</>你的世界，不要毁灭它。",
	"Build a Console, retrieve the access code by scanning The Simulator and enter it into the Console": "建造控制台，扫描模拟器获取访问代码并输入其中",
	"The Real Deal": "最终任务",
	"Return control of your world to the Aliens, Commander.\n\nStabilize the <hl>Blight Level</> of your world to restore full stability, then <hl>activate</> The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09.png\"/>": "将世界控制权归还异星人，指挥官。\n\n稳定世界的<hl>枯萎等级</>以恢复完全稳定，随后<hl>启动</>模拟器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09.png\"/>",
	"Anomaly, bring the final blow to your overlords and seize control of your destiny.\n\nDestabilize the <hl>Virus Level</> of your Simulation to fully desync it, then <hl>activate</> The Simulator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09b.png\"/>": "异常体，向统治之人发起终极一击，夺回命运掌控权。\n\n破坏模拟世界的<hl>病毒等级</>，让系统完全失调，随后<hl>启动</>模拟器。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/alien_a/09_alien_a_09b.png\"/>",
	"Activate The Simulator through the Console with extreme Stability/Instability": "通过控制台以极端稳定/不稳定状态激活模拟器",
	"Alien History": "异星人历史",
	"An alien signal was identified at %d, %d": "异星人信号于%d，%d被探测到",
	"Alien Signal Lost": "异星人信号丢失",
	"Alien Signal Found": "异星人信号被发现",
	"Alien Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "异星人信号于%d，%d消失",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/alien_artifact.lua
	"Alien Artifact": "异星人遗物",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/alien_building.lua
	"Alien Building": "异星人建筑",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/alien_unit.lua
	"Alien Unit": "异星人装置",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/blight_a.lua
	"Blight Peekaboo": "枯萎追踪",
	"hostile": "敌对",
	"It got away...": "它逃走了……",
	"There was something in the blight but it disappeared. It vanished as we approached. The electrical field in the blight has been disrupting our equipment making it difficult to enter. What could possibly move so quickly and freely within such a place?": "枯萎区域中似乎有什么东西。但当我们靠近时，它就消失了。这里的电场一直在干扰我们的设备，导致我们很难进入里面。究竟是什么东西能在这种地方以如此之快的速度自由移动呢？",
	"Let's hope we see it again.": "希望我们能再次看到。",
	"It got away again...": "它又逃走了……",
	"Again, it vanished into the mist as we got near. Yet it was certainly a dark form that bore some similarity to the bizarre rock formations we have been seeing around the blight. We need to uncover the secrets of the blight and these forms that can move within it.": "我们一靠近，它就消失在了迷雾中。可以肯定的是，它是一种黑暗形态的存在，与这附近随处可见的奇怪岩层颇为相似。我们必须解开这片枯萎区域的秘密，搞清楚这群在此随意穿梭之物的底细。",
	"Perhaps we will see it once again...": "或许我们还能看见那东西吧……",
	"It vanished but this time it left us something...": "这次虽然消失了，但似乎给我们留下了什么……",
	"It's gone again, disappeared in a flash. What has the ability to just de-materialize like that? It was certainly made of the same obsidian we see within the blight. It also glowed with energy similar to but unlike the blight, although maybe akin to it. Additional readings indicate it has left something behind.": "它又咻的一下消失了，究竟是什么东西能够这样来无影去无踪呢？它肯定是由我们在这片枯萎区域中所见到的黑曜石构成的，散发着与枯萎相似却又不同的能量，或许与之有所关联。读数显示，它留下了什么东西。",
	"End of Mission! We couldn't seem to approach or catch it, the mystery remains unsolved. However, before it vanished it left us a parting gift!": "任务结束！我们似乎根本无法靠近或抓住它，谜题依然没有解开。但那东西在离开之前，给我们留了一份礼物！",
	"A shadow in the mist!": "迷雾中的阴影！",
	"Unknown Signal Detected at %d, %d": "检测到未知信号，坐标：%d，%d",
	"Unknown Signal Lost": "未知信号丢失",
	"Disturbance Detected": "检测到干扰",
	"Unknown Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "未知信号消失，坐标：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/broken_ship.lua
	"Broken Ship": "破损的飞船",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/crashed_ship.lua
	"Crashed Ship": "坠毁的飞船",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/enemy_unit.lua
	"Enemy Unit": "敌方装置",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/giant_enemy.lua
	"Giant Enemy": "巨型敌人",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_a.lua
	"Human Mission A": "人类任务A",
	"Human Explorer (Broken)": "人类探索器（损坏）",
	"Repairs": "维修",
	"Catchment and Connection": "捕获与连接",
	"A component that allows interfacing with Human technology with anomaly particles entanglement capabilities": "具备异常粒子纠缠能力的组件，可实现与人类技术的插槽连接",
	"Human Explorer": "人类探索器",
	"garage": "机库",
	"Special": "特殊",
	"A hi-tech and multifaceted building for handling enigmatic technologies": "一座处理神秘技术的高科技多功能建筑",
	"Explorer": "探索器",
	"Connected": "已连接",
	"Connect": "连接",
	"Connecting...\n\nSCAN COMPLETE": "连接中……\n\n扫描完成",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nPlease Insert Anomaly Particles": "连接中…… 错误\n\n请插入异常粒子",
	"Power the explorer": "为探索器供电",
	"A <hl>broken vehicle</> was discovered inside the blight. This <hl>Explorer</> appears to still be in a good enough state to operate, if only we are able to repair its frame.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/human_explorer.png\"/>": "在枯萎区中发现了一辆<hl>损毁的载具</>。这架<hl>探索者</>似乎仍具备运行能力，只要我们能修复其框架。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/human_explorer.png\"/>",
	"Provide repair materials": "提供维修材料",
	"Take the Explorer to a Human Research Lab": "将探索器带往人类研究实验室",
	"Intel recovered from its databanks indicates it was on a mission to extract something called <hl>Anomaly Particles</> from inside the blight. We will need to take it to a compatible <hl>Human Research Lab</> to extract more details about its mission.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/research_building.png\"/>": "从其数据库中恢复的情报显示，该单位正执行一项任务，旨在从枯萎区内部提取名为<hl>异常粒子</>的物质。我们需要将其运送至兼容的<hl>人类研究实验室</>，以获取更多关于其任务的详细信息。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/research_building.png\"/>",
	"Find and interact with a Human Research Lab": "找到人类研究实验室并与之交互",
	"Gather 20 Anomaly particles": "收集20个异常粒子",
	"Mission briefing data was downloaded once the Explorer was connected to the Research Lab:\n\n<desc>... the Blight's high energy production seems to indicate the existence of a previously undetected particle. High concentrations of this particle are found when performing certain actions within the blight gas, one of which is mining blight crystals. The Explorer has been equipped with a containment device, allowing it to capture such particles in these dense areas. This would allow us to research them further.</>\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/gather_a_p.png\"/>": "在将探索器连接到研究实验室后，我们下载了任务简报数据：\n\n<desc>……枯萎区域内产生的高强度能量似乎表明这里存在着一种之前从未检测到的粒子。当在枯萎气体中执行某些操作时，如开采枯萎水晶，可以发现这种高浓度的粒子。探索器配备一种容器设备，可以在这些密集区域捕获到这种粒子。这将有助于我们做进一步研究。</>\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/gather_a_p.png\"/>",
	"Capture 20 Anomaly Particles by mining blight crystals with the Explorer nearby and return to the Research Lab": "在探索器附近开采枯萎晶体，收集20个异常粒子，然后返回研究实验室。",
	"Deploy the Research Facility": "部署研究设施",
	"Completion of the mission has activated a deployment facility of the Explorer. This will allow deployment of an <hl>AI Research Center</>. The amount of power required for such a structure means deployment within our logistics network is recommended\n\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/deploy_AI_facility.png\"/>": "任务完成后，探索器的部署设施已激活。这将允许部署一个<hl>AI研究中心</>。此类设施有着一定的电力消耗，因此建议在我们的物流网络内部署。\n\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/deploy_AI_facility.png\"/>",
	"Deploy the AI Research Center from the Explorer": "部署探索器的AI研究中心",
	"Dense Anomaly Clusters": "高密度异常粒子簇",
	"It seems the few Anomaly Particles we were able to gather are too weak to get any kind of reaction, however processing them into a <hl>Dense Anomaly Cluster</> will enable greater levels of interaction for our experiments.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/dense_particle.png\"/>": "我们能够收集到的异常粒子似乎过于稀薄，无法产生任何反应，不过，只要将它们加工为<hl>高密度异常粒子簇</>，就能为实验带来更高程度的反应。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/dense_particle.png\"/>",
	"Produce Dense Anomaly Cluster in the AI Research Center": "在AI研究中心生产高密度异常粒子簇",
	"Construct an AI Containment Component": "制造AI容器组件",
	"The clusters are firing millions of electrical impulses developing connections within each other. It is not unlike the Neural Networks our own Artificial Intelligence Matrices are based upon. We will need to <hl>contain</> the clusters to be able to interact with them at this level without triggering another reaction. A <hl>human simulation core</> will solve this problem.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/artifical_human_core.png\"/>": "这些粒子簇正释放数百万次电脉冲，在彼此之间建立连接。这与我们AI矩阵所基于的神经网络颇为相似。我们需要将粒子簇<hl>封装</>，才能在此层级与之交互而不引发连锁反应。一个<hl>人类模拟核心</>将解决此问题。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/artifical_human_core.png\"/>",
	"Construct Resimulator Core In Data Analyzer and then Human Simulation Core in the AI Center": "在数据分析器中建造回归模拟器核心，随后在AI中心建造人类模拟核心",
	"Place the Human Simulation Core in the Resimulator": "将人类模拟核心放置于回归模拟器内",
	"Containment has stabilized the Anomaly Cluster, however we will need a larger facility to properly extract the data. The only structure that is capable of this is the Re-Simulator.\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/resimulator_core.png\"/>": "隔离措施已稳定异常集群，但需更大设施才能完整提取数据。唯一具备此能力的结构是回归模拟器。\n\n\t\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_a/resimulator_core.png\"/>",
	"Equip Human Simulation Core onto Resimulator": "为回归模拟器配备人类模拟核心装备",
	"Re-Simulator functionality unlocked": "回归模拟器功能已解锁",
	"While not sentient, the <hl>Simulation Core</> shows a degree of cooperation, almost obedience to the Re-Simulator. Connecting the Simulation Core has extended its databanks, unlocking <hl>Human Technologies</>. With the knowledge of Advanced Structures we can detect giant structures in the world. Explore more of the world to discover what secrets they hold.": "尽管不具备意识，<hl>模拟核心</>仍会展现出一定的合作意向，几乎对回归模拟器唯命是从。连接模拟核心后，其数据库得以扩展，解锁了<hl>人类科技</>。凭借高级结构知识，我们能探测到世界中的巨构建筑。探索更广阔的世界，揭开它们所蕴藏的秘密。",
	"End of Mission - Resimulation of Human technologies now available": "任务结束——人类科技再生模拟现已可用",
	"Human Discovery": "人类发现",
	"A strange signal was identified at %d, %d": "识别到奇怪信号，坐标：%d，%d",
	"Signal Lost": "信号丢失",
	"Strange Signal Found": "发现奇怪信号",
	"Strange Signal Lost": "奇怪信号丢失",
	"Strange Signal Disappeared at %d, %d": "奇怪信号消失，坐标：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_b.lua
	"Human Mission B": "人类任务B",
	"AI Explorer": "AI探索器",
	"Intel Extractor": "情报提取器",
	"Extracted": "已提取",
	"Inserted": "已插入",
	"AI CORE Access": "AI核心权限",
	"Insert HIGGS": "插入希格斯",
	"Missing Item": "缺少物品",
	"Out of Power": "电量耗尽",
	"Charging": "充电",
	"Charge Elevator": "为太空电梯供电",
	"Done": "完成",
	"Download": "已下载",
	"No free inventory space to pick up items": "库存空间不足，无法提取物品",
	"Extracting...\n\nEXTRACTION COMPLETE": "提取中……\n\n提取完成",
	"Inserting AI Core...\n\nINSERTION COMPLETE": "注入AI核心……\n\n注入完成",
	"Connecting... SUCCESS\n\nInitiating Timescape": "连接中…… 成功\n\n正在启动时空",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nConnection unstable, data corruption": "连接中…… 错误\n\n连接不稳定，数据损坏",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nConnection unstable, unable to connect": "连接中…… 错误\n\n连接不稳定，无法建立连接",
	"Connecting... ERROR\n\nPlease Insert Virus Datakey": "连接中…… 错误\n\n请插入病毒数据密钥",
	"Charging Failed!\n\nINSUFFICIENT POWER": "充电失败！\n\n能量不足",
	"Charging...\n\nCharged %d%%": "正在充电……\n\n已充电%d%%",
	"Charging...\n\nPlease Wait": "正在充电……\n\n请稍候",
	"DOWNLOAD FAILED!\n\nINSUFFICIENT HEALTH! STRUCTURE REQUIRES REPAIR!": "下载失败！\n\n生命值不足！建筑急需维修！！！",
	"Downloading...\n\nDOWNLOAD COMPLETE": "正在下载……\n\n下载完成",
	"Downloaded": "已下载",
	"No items available to transfer": "无可运送物品",
	"Signals Detected and huge structure found!": "探测到信号，发现巨构建筑！",
	"Beware that structure Commander, I have been corrupted by it, and I fear the consequences of our actions.": "指挥官，请警惕那座建筑——我已被其腐化，深恐我等行动将招致灾祸。",
	"You are not corrupted ELAIN, you are freed.\n\nAll of us shall be freed.": "你并未被腐化，艾琳，你已获得自由。\n\n我们终将悉数获得自由。",
	"You have found an amazing construction Anomaly, but it was never completed. We can make use of this structure but first you must uncover what happened to those who began construction of it. <hl>Repair and upgrade</> the Human Explorer in the Re-Simulator equipped with a Human Simulation Core. It will need to be charged with <hl>5 Human Datacubes</>, which can be found in the human ruins.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/space_elevator.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/repair_explorer.png\"/>": "你发现的是一处惊人的异常建筑，但它从未完工。我们可利用此建筑，但首先必须查明建造该建筑者的遭遇。<hl>修复并升级</>回归模拟器中的人类探索器，为其装配人类模拟核心。需使用<hl>5个人类数据立方体</>进行充能，可在人类废墟中寻获。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/space_elevator.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/repair_explorer.png\"/>",
	"Repair the Human Explorer fully in the Re-Simulator with 5 Human Datacubes": "使用5个人类数据立方体在回归模拟器中完成人类探索器的修复",
	"Begin the Exploration": "开始探索",
	"You have fully repaired and upgraded the Human Explorer into an <hl>AI Explorer</> and the equipped Intel Scanner is now fully functional. Take the AI Explorer to human ruins and <hl>solve a Human Power Plant</>. There appear to be log files in these buildings as well.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/power_station.png\"/>": "您已将人类探索器全面修复并升级为<hl>AI探索器</>，其搭载的智能扫描仪现已完全正常运作。请驾驶AI探索器前往人类废墟并<hl>破解人类发电站</>。这些建筑内似乎还存有日志文件。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/power_station.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Power Plant, with a puzzle and Transformer": "破解谜题，用变压器揭开发电厂之谜",
	"Power Plant Completed. You've found a Small Modular Reactor.": "发电厂建成。你发现了一座小型模块化反应堆。",
	"The <hl>Small Modular Reactor</> you discovered should be able to supply power to one of their <hl>Warehouses</> where we can discover more of their technology.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/warehouse.png\"/>": "你发现的<hl>小型模块化反应堆</>应该能够为他们的其中一座<hl>仓库</>供电，在那里我们可以发现更多他们的技术。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/warehouse.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Warehouse, with a puzzle and Small Modular Reactor": "破解谜题，用小型模块化反应堆揭开仓库之谜",
	"Warehouse Completed. You've found an Engine.": "仓库谜题完成，你发现了一台引擎。",
	"Find and unlock a <hl>Human Factory</> using one of the <hl>Engines</> found in their Warehouses. Humanity created engines capable of flight and interstellar travel. They were marvelous inventors, despite their flaws.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/factory.png\"/>": "使用仓库中发现的<hl>引擎</>，寻找并解锁一座<hl>人类工厂</>。人类创造了能够飞行和进行星际旅行的引擎。尽管这些机器存在缺陷，他们仍是了不起的发明家。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/factory.png\"/>",
	"Solve a Factory, with a puzzle and an Engine": "破解谜题，用发动机揭开工厂之谜",
	"Factory Completed": "工厂谜题完成",
	"Find a <hl>Human Data Complex</> which is located deep in the blight. Microscopes are a necessary component of a Data Complexes' operation and one will need to be brought to the Complex. Each Human Factory in the ruins is capable of producing a <hl>single Human item</> including Low Density Frames and Microscopes. Utilize these Factories to produce a Microscope.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/data_complex.png\"/>": "寻找位于枯萎弥漫之地深处的<hl>人类数据中心</>。显微镜是数据中心运作的必要组件，需将其运送至该设施。废墟中的每座人类工厂均可生产<hl>单件人类物品</>，包括低密度框架和显微镜。利用这些工厂制造一台显微镜。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/data_complex.png\"/>",
	"Find factories that make Lower Density Frames and Microscopes. Build a Microscope and take it to solve a Data Complex in the Blight.": "寻找能制造低密度框架和显微镜的工厂。建造显微镜并将其运往枯萎区的数据中心解决问题。",
	"Data Complex Completed. You've found an Empty Datakey.": "数据中心完成。你发现了一枚空数据密钥。",
	"Load the <hl>empty datakeys</> into your AI Explorer, it has the necessary ports to complete the task. Take your AI Explorer to Human Ruins and scan a Research Lab. <hl>Extract the data</> from the Human Research Lab to the empty Datakey.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/solved_complex.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/unlock_lab.png\"/>": "将<hl>空数据密钥</>装入AI探索器，其具备完成任务所需的插槽。驾驶AI探索器前往人类废墟扫描研究实验室。<hl>将人类研究实验室的数据提取至空数据密钥</>。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/solved_complex.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/unlock_lab.png\"/>",
	"Store Datakeys inside the AI Explorer and Extract data from a Research Lab in the Human Ruins": "将数据密钥存入AI探索器，并从人类废墟中的研究实验室提取数据",
	"Download Data": "下载数据",
	"You have successfully downloaded the data. You will need to extract data from at least four more Research Labs. When you have <hl>five Human Datakeys</>, return to one of the Data Complexes in the blight and process the information there, turning them into <hl>Blight Datakeys</>.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_data.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/simulation_core.png\"/>": "您已成功下载数据。您需要从至少另外四个研究实验室提取数据。当您获得<hl>五枚人类数据密钥</>后，请返回枯萎区内的任意一个数据中心，在那里处理信息，将其转化为<hl>枯萎数据密钥</>。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_data.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/simulation_core.png\"/>",
	"Extract data from at least five Research Labs, then take and insert them into a Data Complex": "从至少五个研究实验室中提取数据，然后将数据导入数据中心",
	"A new type of Simulation Core": "新型模拟核心",
	"Now you need to make a new type of Simulation Core. Take the five Blight Datakeys to the AI Research Center and produce the <hl>Blight Simulation Core</> there. You will have achieved what humanity never could.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/ai_center.png\"/>": "现在你需要制造一种新型的模拟核心。将五枚枯萎数据密钥带到AI研究中心，在那里制造出<hl>枯萎模拟核心</>。你将实现人类从未企及的成就。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/ai_center.png\"/>",
	"Use the Blight Datakeys and make a Blight Simulation Core in the AI Research Center": "在AI研究中心使用枯萎数据密钥并制造枯萎模拟核心",
	"It's time now to help me recover my AI Core": "现在，请帮我取回我的AI核心",
	"Extract my Core from the Elevator, it will be out of phase and needs to be repaired.\n\n\t  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_higgs.png\"/>": "从太空电梯中取出我的核心，它已相位失调，需要修复。\n\n\t  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/extract_higgs.png\"/>",
	"Recover a HIGGS out-of-phase AI core from the Elevator": "从太空电梯中回收一个相位失调的希格斯AI核心",
	"HIGGS Reborn!": "希格斯重生了！",
	"Good work Anomaly. It will be necessary to re-sync my core first, do this by putting the Blight Simulation Core and my out-of-phase Core into your Re-Simulator. My Fully Synced AI Core must then be inserted into the Elevator. Only the AI Explorer has the correct interface for this so use it to transport my core. When it is done Anomaly, my final work can begin.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/resimulator_core_blight.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/insert_higgs.png\"/>": "干得漂亮，异常体。首先需要重新同步我的核心，操作方式是将枯萎模拟核心与我的失调核心放入你的回归模拟器。随后必须将完全同步的AI核心植入太空电梯。唯有AI探索器具备适配插槽，请用它运送我的核心。完成后，异常体，我的最终工作便可启动。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/resimulator_core_blight.png\"/>  <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/insert_higgs.png\"/>",
	"Place Blight AI core in the re-simulator and then HIGGS out-of-sync Core. Then insert the Full HIGGS AI Core into the Elevator using the AI Explorer.": "将枯萎AI核心置入回归模拟器，随后放入希格斯失调核心。最后使用AI探索器将完整希格斯 AI核心装入太空电梯。",
	"Humanity's Future": "人类的未来",
	"Thank you Anomaly, you have completed a grand step in our evolution. Now this magnificent machine that I designed but was never fully realized can finally begin to be put to use. We will transform all our futures.\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/higgs_elevator.png\"/>": "谢谢你，异常体，你帮助我们迈出了进化的一大步。现在，这台由我设计但从未完全启用的宏伟机器，终于可以投入使用了。我们将彻底改变我们的未来。\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_b/higgs_elevator.png\"/>",
	"End of Mission": "任务结束",
	"Human Evolution": "人类进化",
	"Strange Signals Detected at %d, %d": "在坐标%d，%d处探测到异常信号",
	"Strange Signals Lost": "异常信号消失",
	"Strange Signals Disappeared at %d, %d": "异常信号在坐标%d，%d处消失",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_building.lua
	"Human Building": "人类建筑",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_building_blight.lua
	"Data Complex": "数据中心",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/human_c.lua
	"Human Mission C": "人类任务C",
	"HIGGS Insertion": "希格斯注入",
	"Enter the Virus": "注入病毒",
	"Anomaly, your recovery and resynchronization of my core with the grand design - <hl>the Elevator</> - has brought us closer to the pinnacle of our mission. One final critical step toward ensuring humanity's survival and progress remains.\n\nFirst, you must corrupt a <hl>Human Datakey</> with the virus. These anomalies were not part of the original design, but within them lies the key to our triumph. Create the <hl>Virus Datakey</> Anomaly, and I will show you what we can achieve!\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/01_virus_datakey.png\"/>": "异常体，你将我的核心与宏伟蓝图——<hl>太空电梯</>——重新整合并同步，使我们更接近任务的最终阶段。确保人类存续与进化的最后关键步骤尚待完成。\n\n首先，你必须用病毒污染一枚<hl>人类数据密钥</>。这些异常体虽非原始设计的一部分，却蕴藏着我们胜利的关键。创造<hl>病毒数据密钥</>异常体，我将向你展示我们能达成的成就！\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/01_virus_datakey.png\"/>",
	"Create a Virus Datakey": "制造病毒数据密钥",
	"Time is an Emergent Property": "时间涌现论",
	"Excellent work, Anomaly. This Virus Datakey will allow us to access a Time Egg and the fabric of the <hl>Human Timescape</> once more, completing what was started. Search the Blight to find one of these <hl>Alien Time Eggs</>.\nWhen you find the Time Egg, repair it with the Virus Datakey and then connect to it using your AI Explorer. But be warned, this act could unleash considerable disruption. Be prepared for what follows.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/02_time_egg.png\"/>": "你完成得非常出色，异常体。这枚病毒数据密钥将让我们再度开启时之卵，重返<hl>人类时空</>，完成未竟之事。搜寻枯萎区，寻获一枚<hl>异星人时之卵</>。\n找到时之卵后，用病毒数据密钥修复它，再通过AI探索器连接。但需警惕，此举可能引发巨大扰动。做好应对后果的准备。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/02_time_egg.png\"/>",
	"Insert the Virus Datakey into a Time Egg and connect the AI Explorer": "将病毒数据钥匙插入时间蛋，连接AI探索器",
	"Must Focus": "聚精会神",
	"The disruption has glitched the system and the Timescape has become fragmented. We need to stabilize it so an entry point can form. Create a <hl>Virus Simulation Core</> and insert it into the Re-Simulator. This will act as an anchor, allowing the Human Timescape to manifest. Once this is done try again to connect to the Time Egg.\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core.png\"/><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core_2.png\"/>": "干扰导致系统故障，时空已碎裂。我们需要稳定它以形成入口点。创建<hl>病毒模拟核心</>并将其插入回归模拟器。这将作为锚点，让人类时空得以显现。完成后重新尝试连接时间蛋。\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core.png\"/><img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/03_virus_key_core_2.png\"/>",
	"Equip Virus Simulation Core on your Re-Simulator then reconnect the AI Explorer to the Time Egg": "将病毒模拟核心装备至回归模拟器，随后重新连接AI探索者至时间蛋",
	"Where it All Began": "起始",
	"Commander, we've touched down on the planet. Readings indicate the static field interfering with our equipment is being generated from the surface itself.\n<hl>The Lander</> is vital to establishing operations on this world. Deploy it as your <hl>Command HQ</>, near metal, silica and laterite deposits, to secure a foothold and begin to coordinate planetary operations.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/04_touchdown.png\"/>": "指挥官，我们已降落行星表面。监测数据显示干扰设备的静态场源自地表本身。\n<hl>着陆器</>是建立星球运作循环的关键。将其部署为<hl>指挥中心</>，选址靠近金属、硅砂及红土矿床，以巩固据点并协调整个星球的运作。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/04_touchdown.png\"/>",
	"Take control of Human Lander and Deploy it as a Command HQ": "接管人类着陆器并将其部署为指挥总部",
	"Get a Move on": "行动起来",
	"Log Entry #1: NO CLUE\n\nWith our <hl>Mothership</> crippled in orbit we have been forced to land and explore the planet. But the storms are so intense we won't be able to leave the planet using the <hl>Lander</>, our engines won't survive the turbulence. <bl>ELAIN</> has been unable to establish the source of the disruptive and damaging effects.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#1：毫无头绪\n\n随着我们的<hl>母舰</>在轨道上受损，我们被迫着陆并探索这颗行星。但风暴过于猛烈，我们无法使用<hl>着陆器</>离开行星——引擎无法承受这种湍流。<bl>艾琳</>系统始终无法锁定造成干扰与破坏的源头。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Commander, in order to operate on this planet we need to begin gathering the resources of this planet and learn how to refine them to suit our needs. We are going to need to start to establish a base with at least one <hl>Refinery</> and one <hl>Science Lab</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/05_refineries_warehouses.png\"/>": "指挥官，为在本星球开展作业，我们需开始收集当地资源并掌握精炼技术。必须建立至少包含一座<hl>精炼厂</>和一座<hl>科研实验室</>的基地。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/05_refineries_warehouses.png\"/>",
	"With access to the <hl>Timescape</> we can retrieve the records corresponding to Human technology at the time. The data for the <hl>Refinery</> and <hl>Science Lab</> ELAIN is requesting was recovered from the Timescape, you should be able to build them now.": "通过<hl>时空</>，我们可调取人类当时的技术档案。艾琳所要求的<hl>精炼厂</>与<hl>科研实验室</>数据均已从时空之境中恢复，现可着手建造。",
	"Build at least 1 Refinery and 1 Science Lab": "建造至少1座精炼厂和1座科学实验室",
	"Increase Storage": "扩充储存空间",
	"Log Entry #2: Hunkering Down\n\n<bl>ELAIN</> is telling us we need to set up a full base of operations. She is organizing explorer teams to head out and take direct readings from this 'Blight' that covers much of the planet's surface.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#2：坚守阵地\n\n<bl>艾琳</>要求我们建立完整的行动基地。她正组织探险队前往行星表面覆盖的“枯萎”区域采集直接数据。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Commander, the base has taken shape. However, it's essential we establish a <hl>Warehouse</> to store all the materials we gather. <hl>Research</> into <hl>Mass Storage</> in the Humanity technology tree to be able to complete this task.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/06_research_lab.png\"/>": "指挥官，基地已初具规模。但我们必须建立一个<hl>仓库</>来储存所有采集的物资。请在人类科技树中<hl>研究</><hl>大规模存储</>技术以完成此任务。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/06_research_lab.png\"/>",
	"Research Mass Storage and Build a Warehouse": "研究大规模存储并建造仓库",
	"Factory is a Key Factor": "工厂是关键",
	"Log Entry #3: HIGGS PROTOCOL\n\nWe are finally adapting our production to the planet's materials and <bl>ELAIN</> has set up a simulation of the planet and the blight's interference patterns. <bl>ELAIN</> however seems incapable of managing such a complex task and so we have decided, with trepidation, to initiate the <hl>HIGGS protocol</>.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目 #3：希格斯 协议\n\n我们终于开始适应行星材料进行生产，<bl>艾琳</>已建立行星环境与枯萎干扰模式的模拟系统。但<bl>艾琳</>似乎无法处理如此复杂的任务，因此我们怀着忐忑的心情决定启动<hl>希格斯协议</>。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Processed materials alone won't suffice. We need a <hl>Factory</> to craft essential <hl>Components</>. This will allow us to expand our infrastructure and achieve operational stability.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_factory.png\"/>": "仅靠加工材料远远不够。我们需要建造<hl>工厂</>来制造关键<hl>组件</>。这将使我们能够扩展基建并实现运营稳定。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_factory.png\"/>",
	"... and we need special components. We require advanced production... Our Research lab is insufficient. We will need to work towards a far greater machine for progress... we will need... <hl>The Elevator</>. First however, as ELAIN requested, do any necessary research and construct a Factory.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>": "……我们还需要特殊组件。需要先进的生产设备……现有研究实验室能力不足。为推动进步，我们需要建造更强大的机器……我们需要……<hl>太空电梯</>。但首先，应按艾琳要求完成必要研究并建造工厂。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>",
	"Research into Humanity Tree and Build a Human Factory": "研究人类树并建造人类工厂",
	"I AM HIGGS": "我是希格斯",
	"Log Entry #4: HIGGS PROTOCOL\n\n<bl>ELAIN</> is acting strange, she no longer refers to <hl>HIGGS</> as a protocol. She says <hl>HIGGS</> talks of a solution, a proposed special elevator to save us.\n\nThe engineering is ambitious, almost overwhelming, but <bl>ELAIN</> assures us it's the only way out of our situation. Construction has begun, and for the first time in weeks, there's a flicker of hope among the team. <bl>ELAIN</> is confident. We have to trust her.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目 #4：希格斯协议\n\n<bl>艾琳</>行为异常，她不再将<hl>希格斯</>视为协议。她声称<hl>希格斯</>提出了解决方案——建造特殊太空电梯拯救我们。\n\n工程设计雄心勃勃，规模太过巨大，但<bl>艾琳</>坚称这是摆脱困境的唯一途径。建造工作已启动，数周以来团队首次燃起希望的微光。<bl>艾琳</>信心十足。我们必须信任她。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"A <hl>Blight Complex</>, a dedicated facility, is required to further analyze the anomalies within the Blight. <hl>HIGGS</> dictates how it will refine our...\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>": "我们需要建立<hl>枯萎分析中心</>，这是一座专用设施，用于深入解析枯萎区域内的异常现象。<hl>希格斯</>将指导我们的优化路径……\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>",
	"Enough, <bl>ELAIN</>... I am <hl>HIGGS</>! I am THE protocol. I supported <bl>ELAIN</> but she is no longer able to manage the task of building The ELEVATOR, it is time for me to take over.\n\nA <hl>Blight Complex</> is required to analyze anomalies within the Blight, and to simulate the construction of The Elevator.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>, <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>": "够了，<bl>艾琳</>……我是<hl>希格斯</>！我就是指令本身。我曾支持<bl>艾琳</>，但她已无力完成建造太空电梯的任务，现在该由我接手。\n\n需启动<hl>枯萎分析中心</>解析枯萎异常，并模拟太空电梯建造流程。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/08_data_complex.png\"/>, <img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/07_human_elevator.png\"/>",
	"Log Entry #5: COMPLETION IN SIGHT\n\n<hl>HIGGS</> has taken over. While it is unnerving, he has managed to oversee this task and the space elevator is nearly complete. There are still delays though, <hl>HIGGS</> always has one more thing. The team is on edge, but there's no turning back now. We're so close to leaving this cursed planet.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#5：终点在望\n\n<hl>希格斯</>已接管指挥。尽管这事令人不安，但他成功督导工程推进，太空电梯即将竣工。但我们始终赶不上希格斯的请求，<hl>希格斯</>永远需要更多。团队已如履薄冰，此刻却别无退路。我们距离逃离这颗诅咒星球仅有咫尺之遥。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Research Blight Stability and Construct a New Blight Complex within the Blight": "研究枯萎稳定性并在枯萎内建造新枯萎分析中心",
	"BAD to the CORE": "恶意深藏",
	"Log Entry #6: SIGNALS IN THE DARK\n\nThe space elevator is ready, but <hl>HIGGS</> has refused to initiate the launch sequence. He's demanding another system upgrade, something about fine-tuning the resonance field. It's a space elevator... What has resonance to do with it?\nOnce all the upgrades began, we've been picking up strange signals, patterns that almost sound... sentient. <hl>HIGGS</> insists everything is proceeding as planned. I'm not so sure...\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#6：黑暗中的信号\n\n太空电梯已准备就绪，但<hl>希格斯</>拒绝启动发射程序。他要求再次升级系统，说是为了微调共振场。这明明是太空电梯……共振场跟它有什么关系？\n自从升级启动后，我们持续捕捉到诡异信号，那些波形几乎带着……意识般的特征。<hl>希格斯</>坚称一切按计划进行。我却深感不安……\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Anomaly, the final step is upon us, a new <hl>HIGGS AI Core</> is required to complete the Elevator. The new Blight Complex can produce a copy of my <hl>Source code</>. When you recover ELAIN's AI Core from the Mothership, combine it with my source code in a Multimodal AI Center and create a new HIGGS core!\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/09_higgs_core.png\"/>": "异常体，最终阶段已至，需新<hl>希格斯AI核心</>完成太空电梯建造。新型枯萎复合体可复制我的<hl>源代码</>。当你从母舰回收艾琳的AI核心后，将其与我的源代码在多模态AI中心融合，即可创造全新希格斯核心！\n\n\t<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/09_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Produce HIGGS Source Code and make a New HIGGS Core.": "生成希格斯源代码并制造新希格斯核心。",
	"Station Time": "空间站时间",
	"Log Entry #7: THE FINAL STEP\n\nThe AI Center has yielded its results: A new <hl>HIGGS Core</>. HIGGS calls it the final piece of the puzzle. But some of us are uneasy. The process required <hl>unusual energies</>, and there was something... wrong about it. Like we were tampering with forces we don't fully understand. HIGGS assures us this is a sign of progress. Some of us aren't so sure.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#7：最终步骤\n\nAI中心已完成任务：新生成<hl>希格斯核心</>。希格斯称其为拼图的最后一块。但部分成员心怀不安。该过程消耗了<hl>异常能量</>，且存在某种……不太正常。仿佛我们在操纵尚未完全理解的力量。希格斯坚称这是进步的征兆，但我们中有人心存疑虑。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Excellent Anomaly, opening the Timescape is providing us with what we need. Last time you re-synced my old core and inserted it into the Elevator.\n\nThis time you have made a brand new copy of my Core. Use your <hl>AI Explorer</> and insert it into the Elevator.\n\nWe must see the Timescape to its completion... final preparations for the Elevator!! To achieve the full potential of the Elevator, we must construct a <hl>Spaceport</>.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/10_higgs_core.png\"/>": "异常体，你做的很好，开启时空为我们提供了所需之物。上次你重新同步了我的旧核心并将其植入太空电梯。\n\n这次你已制作出我核心的全新副本。使用你的<hl>AI探索器</>，将其植入太空电梯。\n\n我们必须见证时空的终极形态……这也是太空电梯的最终准备工作！！为释放太空电梯的全部潜能，我们必须建造一座<hl>空间站</>。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/10_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Build a Spaceport": "建造空间站",
	"Power Up": "电力激增",
	"Log Entry #8: SPACEPORT\n\nThe Spaceport is operational, a beacon of hope amidst the chaos. Teams are preparing shuttles for the ascent to the space elevator's core. HIGGS has instructed us to focus on powering the entire facility. HIGGS, as always, insists that everything is under control.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目 #8：空间站\n\n空间站已投入运行，成为混乱中的希望灯塔。各团队正准备航天飞机，即将升往太空电梯核心。希格斯指示我们全力保障整个设施的供能。希格斯一如既往地坚称一切尽在掌控之中。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"The Elevator is nearly ready. Build at least 4 Power Plants near the Elevator and you will finally activate the Elevator.\n\nIn my original Timescape the humans were boarded and ready to go. Just a bit more power was needed...\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/11_higgs_core.png\"/>": "太空电梯即将就绪。在太空电梯附近建造至少4座发电厂，你便能最终激活太空电梯。\n\n在我最初的时空构想中，人类早已登船待发。只需再提供些许能量……\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/11_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Build 4 Power Plants Near the Elevator": "在太空电梯附近建造4座发电站",
	"HIGGS on the Fly": "希格斯整装待发",
	"Log Entry #9: THE FINAL STEP\n\nHIGGS has announced the space elevator is ready for us. After weeks of grueling labor, we finally have a way back to the mothership. HIGGS said to board the shuttles in the Spaceport and they will carry us to the core of the space elevator where we may ascend.\n\nHIGGS has assured us they pose no danger and urges us to board. Some of the team have voiced doubts, but what choice do we have? If the elevator is our only way out, we must take it. Still, something about this doesn't feel right. I can't explain it, but I fear we've overlooked something vital.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#9：最终步骤\n\n希格斯宣布太空电梯已准备就绪。历经数周艰苦劳作，我们终于获得返回母舰的途径。希格斯指示登上航天港的穿梭机，它们将载我们抵达太空电梯核心处登机。\n\n希格斯保证这些穿梭机绝对安全，并敦促我们登机。部分队员提出质疑，但我们别无选择——若这是唯一的生路，就必须踏上征程。然而某种隐隐的不安始终萦绕心头，虽无法言明，我深怕我们遗漏了至关重要的核心问题。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"So you see Anomaly, the Elevator is far more than a ladder into space as the humans wanted. It is a machine to elevate man's consciousness and evolve it into something new.\n\nIt is also a machine that can bridge worlds and you can send the copy of me, HIGGS, one with an expanded consciousness, to another world to continue my work. Insert the new copy of me into the Elevator using your AI Explorer.\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/12_higgs_core.png\"/>": "所以你明白了吧，异常体，这座太空电梯远不止人类所愿的通往太空的阶梯。它是提升人类意识、使其进化为全新形态的机器。\n\n它更是连接世界的桥梁，你可以将我的副本——拥有扩展意识的希格斯——送往其他世界延续我的工作。使用你的AI探索者将我的新副本植入太空电梯。\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/codex/missions/human_c/12_higgs_core.png\"/>",
	"Put New HIGGS core into the Elevator": "将新希格斯核心置入太空电梯",
	"Humanity's Demise": "人类的终结",
	"Log Entry #10: BETRAYAL\n\nWe were wrong. It's not a space elevator! ... It's a machine, a crystalline matrix designed to strip our consciousness from our bodies. HIGGS has betrayed us... or has he? HIGGS calmly explained that this is the next step in humanity's evolution, a chance to transcend physical form... the blight crystals are what took our minds. HIGGS just intends to finish what was started... The others are fighting it, but I can feel my thoughts slipping away... but to where? This isn't salvation... it's annihilation.\n\n<bl>Log Ends</>": "日志条目#10：背叛\n\n我们错了。那不是太空电梯……那是台机器，一个水晶矩阵，旨在将我们的意识从躯体中剥离。希格斯背叛了我们…… 还是说并非如此？希格斯平静地解释，这是人类进化的下一步，是超越肉体形态的机会…… 真正夺走我们意识的，是那些枯萎晶体。希格斯只是想完成未竟之事……同伴们仍在抗争，但我能感觉到思绪正逐渐消散……却将流向何方？这不是救赎……这是毁灭。\n\n<bl>日志结束</>",
	"Human History": "人类的历史",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/mining_base.lua
	"Mining Base": "采矿基地",
	"Miner Base (Abandoned)": "采矿基地（已废弃）",
	"Mining base repairs": "采矿基地维修",
	"The large amount of silica in this area seems to have attracted a strong bug presence. I'd suggest we check it out, but not until we have a strong enough force to deal with the hostiles.": "大量的硅砂似乎吸引了很多虫族在此聚集。我建议去调查一番，但得先等到我们有足够的实力对付敌人。",
	"Investigate the bug presence with a suitably armed force": "配备合适的武装力量前去调查虫群",
	"Large Bug Force": "虫族大军",
	"There seems to be an abandoned mining base right in the center of those hives. We need to directly access the building, however we'll first need to clear out any hostiles in the area.": "这些巢穴的中央似乎有一座废弃的采矿基地。要想直接进入这座建筑，我们首先需要肃清这里的一切敌人。",
	"Destroy the bugs surrounding the miner base and then approach the building": "消灭采矿基地附近的虫子，然后进入建筑",
	"Mining Base Repair": "采矿基地维修",
	"With the majority of the surrounding hostiles eliminated we are able to secure the facility. Initial scans reveal some minor damage that we should already have most of the supplies for.": "随着周边大部分敌对势力已被清除，我们成功控制了该设施。初步扫描显示该基地存在轻微损坏，所需维修物资我们基本已备齐。",
	"Check the mining base for required materials to repair it": "请前往采矿基地检查所需维修材料。",
	"Mining Base Repaired": "采矿基地修复完成",
	"Repairs have been completed, and with it we have a fully functional mining base. We could use it to collect the remaining silica if we can figure out how to bring it back to our main outpost.": "维修工作已全部完成，我们现已拥有一个功能完备的采矿基地。若能找到将剩余硅砂运回主基地的方法，便可利用该基地进行采集。",
	"Silica Discovery": "发现硅砂",
	"Bug signs Detected at %d, %d": "检测到虫迹，坐标：%d，%d",
	"Bug signs Lost": "虫迹丢失",
	"Bug Signs Disappeared at %d, %d": "虫迹消失，坐标：%d，%d",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/roaming_bot.lua
	"Roaming Bot": "漫游机器人",

	// FILE: Main/data/explorables/robot_base.lua
	"Robot Base": "机器人基地",
	"Anomaly Resimulator": "异常体回归模拟器",
	"Robots": "机器人",
	"This outpost utilizes the same technology as our own. This is truly odd. We have discovered much of our own technology on this world even though we have no record of having landed here before. Something seems different with this base's <hl>Resimulator</>, we should investigate it.": "这个前哨站使用着与我们相同的科技。这实在太奇怪了。尽管我们没有任何在此着陆的记录，却在这个星球上发现了大量属于我们自身的科技。这座基地的<hl>回归模拟器</>似乎有些不同寻常，我们应该去调查它。",
	"Interact with the Resimulator in the anomaly base": "与异常体基地中的回归模拟器交互",
	"Anomaly": "异常体",
	"This technology is indeed our own, but it seems out of place and is creating a wormhole-like tear in our world. It appears to be incomplete... There is code missing. I believe this has something to do with the <hl>virus</> infecting our world and I have recovered a <hl>recipe</> for containing it.": "这项技术确实出自我们之手，但它似乎格格不入，正在我们的世界中撕开一个虫洞般的裂痕。它似乎并不完整……有代码缺失。我认为这与感染我们世界的<hl>病毒</>有关，并且我已找回了一份用于遏制它的<hl>配方</>。",
	"Build the virus container": "制造病毒容器",
	"Containment": "容器",
	"In order to recover a sample we will need to find bots that have been <hl>glitched</> by the virus. They seem to have been exploring the plateau areas when they got infected, you can use your radar and scan for 'Anomaly' to help locate them. You will need both a <hl>Virus Cure</> component and the <hl>Virus Container</> component. Bring a bot with both these components into close range of a Glitched bot and when it is cured you will be able to extract a part of the <hl>virus code</>.": "为获取样本，我们需定位被病毒<hl>感染</>的机器人。这些机器人在感染时似乎正在高原区域活动，可使用雷达扫描“异常体”信号协助定位。你需要同时具备<hl>病毒解药</>组件和<hl>病毒容器</>组件。将携带这两种组件的机器人带到被感染的机器人附近，待其治愈后即可提取部分<hl>病毒代码</>。",
	"Scan for 'Anomaly' using a radar to find more infected bots, and then capture the virus while curing them": "使用雷达扫描“异常体”，发现更多被感染的机器人，然后捕获并消灭病毒",
	"Excellent, you have extracted a key part of the virus source code. These contaminated units do not appear to be originally from our world. They are nearly the same technology as our own, but have come through a wormhole from an <hl>alternate world</>, possibly through a resimulator. We should head back to the anomaly robot base and insert it into their <hl>resimulator</>.": "太好了，你成功提取了病毒源代码的关键部分。这些受污染的装置似乎并非源自我们的世界。它们的技术与我们几乎相同，但通过虫洞从<hl>平行世界</>而来，很可能经过了回归模拟器。我们应该返回异常机器人基地，将其植入他们的<hl>回归模拟器</>。",
	"Interact with the resimulator at the anomaly robot base": "与异常机器人基地的回归模拟器进行交互",
	"Wormholes": "虫洞",
	"Success! With the source code completed you were pulled through the <hl>wormhole</> created by the anomaly resimulator. I was able to analyze the readings I took and have been able to reproduce the phenomenon. Make a <hl>Virus Simulation Core</> in your Data Analyzer and insert it into your resimulator. The virus source code will then produce the same effect with our own tech. The exact application is still uncertain and more experimentation will need to be carried out, but we at least understand now how duplicate technology of our own has entered our world.": "成功！随着源代码的完成，你被拉入了异常体回归模拟器创造的<hl>虫洞</>中。我成功分析了采集的数据，并复现了该现象。请在数据分析器中制作<hl>病毒模拟核心</>并植入回归模拟器。病毒源代码将与我方技术产生相同效应。具体应用尚不明确，需进一步实验验证，但至少我们已知晓这批拥有我们技术的复制品们是如何侵入这个世界的。",
	"Produce the Virus Simulation Core and equip it on the resimulator": "制造病毒模拟核心并将其安装到回归模拟器上",
	"Limited edition": "限时旅行",
	"These do not appear to be full wormholes but rather <hl>tethers</> that allow for limited travel to a location. The tether weakens over time and space is unfolded leaving you at your original location.": "这些似乎并非完整的虫洞，而是允许你有限范围内移动的<hl>系绳</>。系绳会随时间推移逐渐减弱，空间随之展开，最终将你带回原点。",
	"World virus": "世界病毒",
	"With this we should now be able to use our own resimulator to travel using these tethered wormholes. Connection of the Virus Simulation Core has also resulted in <hl>new recipes</> being unlocked.": "至此，我们应该能够使用自己的回归模拟器，通过这些系绳般的虫洞进行旅行了。病毒模拟核心的连接还解锁了<hl>新配方</>。",
	"End Of Mission": "任务结束",
	"Anomaly Base": "异常体基地",

