	"So tall": "真高",
	"We are detecting some kind of anomaly in the world.\n\nOne the natural flora of the world is giving unusual readings. It appears mineable except scans indicate it has an extremely hard outer shell.\n\nIt's too strong to mine but perhaps there is some other way to acquire its resources.": "我们检测到这世界出现了某种异常现象。\n\n这个世界上的某种天然植物出现了不同寻常的读数。它似乎可以进行开采，但扫描结果显示，它的外壳异常坚硬。\n\n过于坚硬的特性导致它无法被正常开采，但或许有其他方法可以让我们获得其中的资源。",
	"Destroy Giant Tree": "摧毁巨树",
	"Disturbed the Hive!": "惊扰了虫巢！",
	"The tree acted as a giant hive. You'll need to eliminate all hostiles in the area before destroying it.": "这棵树就像一个巨型的虫巢。你必须先清除该区域所有敌对目标，才能将其摧毁。",
	"Clear the area of enemies and destroy the giant tree hive": "清除区域内的敌人并摧毁巨树巢穴",
	"Composition": "组成结构",
	"The trunk of the tree was made entirely of silica.\n\nWhile this one had matured and hardened too much to be mined there appears to be smaller ones that we should be able to extract small amounts of silica.\n\nThis should help us set up our initial silicon production.": "树干全部由硅砂构成。\n\n虽然这棵巨树已经成熟，并且异常坚硬，无法开采，但似乎还有一些个头较小的树，我们可以从中开采出少量硅砂。\n\n这样，我们就可以启动第一次硅砂生产了。",
	"End of Mission - Silica Resources Acquired": "任务结束 - 已获取硅砂资源",
	"That's a big tree!": "好大一棵树！",
	"Big tree detected at %d, %d": "检测到巨树，坐标：%d，%d",
	"Tree was Destroyed": "巨树已被摧毁",
	"Anomaly Detected": "检测到异常",
	"Abnormal readings detected at %d, %d": "检测到异常读数，坐标：%d，%d",
	"Anomaly Disappeared": "异常消失",
