	"Demo Completion Time: %s\n\nIn the full version of Desynced, further exciting adventures and tech tree exploration awaits you! You are free however to continue playing this trial version.\n\nDon't forget to WISHLIST Desynced on STEAM. We look forward to playing alongside you in the full version!": "试玩版完成时间：%s\n\n在《智械工厂 Desynced》完整版中，还有更多激动人心的冒险和科技树探索等待着您！当然，您也可以继续游玩本试用版。\n\n别忘了在STEAM上将《智械工厂 Desynced》加入愿望单。我们期待在完整版中与您并肩作战！",
