	"The unit to set component register on (if not self)": "设置组件寄存器的目标装置（若非自身）",
	"Value to set remotely": "远程设置的数值",
	"Failed to set register": "设置寄存器失败",
	"Set to Component Remotely": "远程设置组件",
	"Writes a value into a component register on an external unit": "向外部装置的组件寄存器写入数值",
	"Remotely set an external unit's component register to a value. Diverts logic if instruction fails.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "远程将外部装置的组件寄存器设置为指定值。指令失败时进行逻辑分流。\n\n源装置与目标装置<bl>必须相邻</>，除非运行于<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"The unit to get component register from (if not self)": "获取组件寄存器的装置（若非自身）",
	"Component and register number to get remotely": "需远程获取的组件及寄存器编号",
	"Failed to get register": "获取寄存器失败",
	"Get from Component Remotely": "远程获取组件值",
	"Reads a value from a component register on an external unit": "从外部装置读取组件寄存器数值",
	"Remotely read an external unit's component register value. Diverts logic if instruction fails.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "远程读取外部装置的组件寄存器值。指令失败时进行逻辑分流。\n\n源装置与目标装置<bl>必须相邻</>，除非运行于<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>。",
	"The unit to load the behavior on (if not self)": "加载行为的目标装置（若非自身）",
	"Load Behavior": "加载行为",
	"Load and run a behavior on an external unit": "在外部装置加载并运行行为",
	"Remotely run a behavior on another unit. Will automatically install an <img id=\"c_integrated_behavior\" style=\"hl\"/> if needed.\n\nThe source and target units <bl>must be adjacent</> unless running on an <img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>.": "远程在另一装置运行行为。必要时将自动安装<img id=\"c_integrated_behavior\" style=\"hl\"/>。\n\n源装置与目标装置<bl>必须相邻</>，或者在<img id=\"c_autobase\" style=\"hl\"/>上运行。",
	"Id to register with": "寄存的ID",
	"Build Registered": "建造寄存建筑",
	"Places a building to be registered": "放置待寄存的建造",
	"Constructs a structure or unit defined in a register at a given location or the current location if not specified.": "在指定位置（或默认当前位置）建造寄存器中定义的结构或装置。",
	"Produce Registered Unit": "生产寄存装置",
	"AutoBase-only instruction that starts production of a unit blueprint and registers it under the requested id.\n\nIf the AutoBase already has enough registered units for the requested id and amount, it does nothing. If an idle matching production component is available, it assigns the blueprint and continues through <hl>If Working</> while waiting for production to progress.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nThe production selector controls which unit blueprint is produced and adds any ingredient/blueprint pins needed by that selection.": "此指令仅供 AutoBase 使用，用于启动单位蓝图的生产并将其注册到请求的 ID 下。\n\n如果 AutoBase 已注册了足够数量的单位，且 ID 和数量与请求的 ID 相符，则此指令不执行任何操作。如果存在空闲的匹配生产组件，则此指令会分配蓝图，并在等待生产完成期间继续执行 <hl>如果有效</> 操作。\n\n<hl>节点设置</>\n生产选择器控制生产哪个单位蓝图，并添加该选择所需的任何原料/蓝图引脚。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Signal value": "信号值",
	"Radio Event": "无线电事件",
	"Run event when the signal of the specified radio band changes its value": "当指定无线电频段的信号值发生变化时触发事件",
	"Starts this branch when the selected radio band receives a new value.\n\nThe band is selected in the node body, not through an input pin. When the event fires, <hl>Signal</> receives the new radio value.\n\nUse this for event-driven behaviors that should sleep until a radio signal changes instead of polling with <hl>Read Radio</>.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nThe band chooses the radio channel to watch. If no band is selected, no event watcher is installed.": "当选定的无线电频段接收到新值时，此分支启动。\n\n频段的选择在节点主体中进行，而非通过输入引脚。事件触发时，<hl>信号</> 会接收新的无线电值。\n\n对于需要等待无线电信号变化的事件驱动行为，请使用此分支，而不是使用 <hl>读取无线电</> 进行轮询。\n\n<hl>节点设置</>\n频段用于选择要监视的无线电频道。如果未选择频段，则不会安装事件监视器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Parameter Event": "参数事件",
	"Run event when the value of the specified parameter changes": "当指定参数的值发生变化时触发事件",
	"Starts this branch when the selected behavior parameter changes value.\n\nThe watched parameter is selected in the node body. This is useful for behaviors that should react immediately when a controller register is edited or linked from another register.\n\n<hl>Node Settings</>\nParameter chooses which behavior parameter to watch. If no parameter is selected, no event watcher is installed.": "当选定的行为参数值发生变化时，启动此分支。\n\n被监视的参数在节点主体中选择。这对于在控制器寄存器被编辑或从另一个寄存器链接时应立即做出反应的行为非常有用。\n\n<hl>节点设置</>\n参数用于选择要监视的行为参数。如果未选择任何参数，则不会安装事件监视器。", // <temporary automatic translation>
