	"Id/Index": "ID/索引", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Array identifier and index": "数组标识符和索引",
	"Memory Get": "内存获取",
	"Get memory array element": "获取内存数组元素",
	"Memory": "内存",
	"Retrieves a value from a named memory location. If no number index is specified it will get the value of the last element in the array.": "从命名内存位置获取值。若未指定数字索引，则获取数组末尾元素的值。",
	"Old": "旧值",
	"Previous value": "先前值",
	"Memory Set": "内存设置",
	"Set memory array value at a given index": "在指定索引处设置内存数组值",
	"Set memory array value at a given index. No index will add a new element to the end of the array (push).": "在指定索引处设置内存数组值。未指定索引时将在数组末尾添加新元素（入栈）。",
	"Array identifier or empty to process known identifiers": "数组标识符或空数组用于处理已知标识符", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Length": "长度", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Memory Length": "内存长度",
	"Get length of memory array": "获取内存数组长度",
	"Retrieves the length of a memory array.\n\nWill return the length of the memory array specified by the array identifier <hl>Id</> or the total number of arrays in memory if no <hl>Id</> is specified.": "获取内存数组的长度。\n\n将返回由数组标识符 <hl>Id</> 指定的内存数组的长度；如果未指定 <hl>Id</>，则返回内存中数组的总数。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Memory Insert": "内存插入",
	"Insert value into memory array": "向内存数组插入值",
	"Insert value into memory array, shifting elements above upwards. No index will add a new element to the end of the array (push).": "向内存数组插入值，上方元素向上位移。未指定索引时在数组末尾添加新元素（入栈）。",
	"Old Value": "旧值",
	"Removed value": "已移除值",
	"Memory Remove": "内存移除",
	"Remove value from memory array": "从内存数组移除值",
	"Remove value from a memory array, shifting elements above downwards.\nNo index will remove from the end of the array (pop).\nSpecifying ∞ will clear the array.": "从内存数组移除指定值，上方元素向下移动。\n未指定索引时将从数组末尾移除（弹出）。\n指定∞将清空数组。",
	"Filter value": "筛选值", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Remove Count": "移除计数", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Memory Sift": "记忆筛选", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Remove multiple items of a memory array with a filter": "使用过滤器从内存数组中移除多个元素。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Remove multiple items of a memory array depending on the filter comparison mode and value.\n\nIf an identifier <hl>Id</> is specified, values of the array with that identifier will be filtered.\nOtherwise the instruction will remove full arrays depending on their identifier keys.": "根据筛选比较模式和值，从内存数组中移除多个元素。\n\n如果指定了标识符 `<hl>Id</>`，则会筛选出数组中具有该标识符的值。\n否则，该指令将根据标识符键移除整个数组。", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Loop Memory": "遍历内存",
	"Loops through memory array or known array identifiers": "遍历内存数组或已知数组标识符",
	"Loops through all entries stored in a memory list.\n\nIf an identifier <hl>Id</> is specified, all sequential values of the array with that identifier will be evaluated, starting from 1.\nOtherwise the instruction will enumerate over all identifier keys in the memory.": "遍历内存列表中存储的所有条目。\n\n如果指定了标识符 `<hl>Id</>`，则会从 1 开始计算数组中所有具有该标识符的连续值。\n否则，该指令将枚举内存中的所有标识符键。", // <temporary automatic translation>

