	"Off": "关闭",
	"<hl>None</> - Enemy bugs will not spawn\n<hl>Passive</> - Enemy bugs will become hostile if attacked\n<hl>Aggressive</> - Enemy bugs will attack if you get close\n<hl>Swarm</> - Enemy bugs will spread and attack discovered players": "<hl>无</> - 敌方虫群不会生成\n<hl>被动</> - 受攻击时敌方虫群将转为敌对\n<hl>主动</> - 靠近时敌方虫群将主动攻击\n<hl>群聚</> - 敌方虫群将扩张并攻击被发现的玩家",
	"<hl>Normal</> - Normal bumpy landscape generation\n<hl>Flat</> - Flat desert and grasslands to make building bases easier": "<hl>正常</> - 生成常规起伏地形\n<hl>平坦</> - 生成平坦沙漠与草原，便于建造基地",
