	"Branches execution based on the altitude of the unit. Defaults to the unit the behavior is equipped on\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/behaviors/check_altitude.png\"/>\n\nOptional parameter <hl>Target</> can specify a different unit to check. An extra pin becomes available for when the unit is not visible to you.": "根据装置海拔高度执行分支。默认以装备该行为的装置为基准\n\n<img image=\"Main/textures/behaviors/check_altitude.png\"/>\n\n可选<hl>目标</>参数以指定检查其他装置。当装置处于不可见状态时，将额外提供一个标记。", // From file: Main/data/instructions.lua
